(2554194, 353409, 16004, '<td valign="top">hee!  i would have though it would be more of a challenge to find a car without the flag in the last week or so!  from the wing mirror and the door handle and similar details, you can tell this is a sharp, well timed, well captured moving image; but it feels let down by the flappiness of the flag.  i think this is where the motion blur requirement of the challenge doesn''t quite fit the nature of the shot.  it''s a pity it wasn''t a flag not saying england - i think the lack of text would make it appear less apparently flappy.<br/> <br/>it''s also let down a bit by the agressive crop of the cars nose and the tightness towards the rear.  the only way round this would be to crop much closer to the flag.  still, merit should be given in that it is a welcome non-conformist shot from the typical car panning picture, and the motion blur is caught in such a way that it gives a great impression of speed.  6.</td>', 'hee!  i would have though it would be more of a challenge to find a car without the flag in the last week or so!  from the wing mirror and the door handle and similar details, you can tell this is a sharp, well timed, well captured moving image; but it feels let down by the flappiness of the flag.  i think this is where the motion blur requirement of the challenge doesn''t quite fit the nature of the shot.  it''s a pity it wasn''t a flag not saying england - i think the lack of text would make it appear less apparently flappy. it''s also let down a bit by the agressive crop of the cars nose and the tightness towards the rear.  the only way round this would be to crop much closer to the flag.  still, merit should be given in that it is a welcome non-conformist shot from the typical car panning picture, and the motion blur is caught in such a way that it gives a great impression of speed.  6.', '2006-06-26 09:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554200, 351943, 16004, '<td valign="top">apart from the unfotunate result that it looks like he has no arms, this is a good picture and take on the challenge.  best bit is the unconventional viewpoint, as it does stir interest.  the colours could do with a bit of lifting in some way; his face appears a bit blue, and the greens a tad washed out.  a bit more contrast and a slight red increase might give more natural colours.  nice happy feeling shot though. 6.</td>', 'apart from the unfotunate result that it looks like he has no arms, this is a good picture and take on the challenge.  best bit is the unconventional viewpoint, as it does stir interest.  the colours could do with a bit of lifting in some way; his face appears a bit blue, and the greens a tad washed out.  a bit more contrast and a slight red increase might give more natural colours.  nice happy feeling shot though. 6.', '2006-06-26 09:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554201, 352902, 35357, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, frogs legs!</td>', 'Mmmm, frogs legs!', '2006-06-26 09:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554207, 353716, 35357, '<td valign="top">paralax, sweet!</td>', 'paralax, sweet!', '2006-06-26 09:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554221, 351587, 16004, '<td valign="top">i ike the slightly surrealness of this picture; puts me in mind of "fight club" for some reason...  i like that the subject is the blur, rather than the background, which i think is a creative take on the challenge.  it feels wonky though, even though the horizon does look horizontal - i''m not sure what it is (camber in the road surface, illusion of the taller trees on the left?) but it is a distraction.  as is the big street light right above your subject; i think you could have got round this by doing a more wide-screen type crop, like 10mm above and below your subject; not sure this would be 160px though...  like it overall though, both conceptually and in execution. 7.</td>', 'i ike the slightly surrealness of this picture; puts me in mind of "fight club" for some reason...  i like that the subject is the blur, rather than the background, which i think is a creative take on the challenge.  it feels wonky though, even though the horizon does look horizontal - i''m not sure what it is (camber in the road surface, illusion of the taller trees on the left?) but it is a distraction.  as is the big street light right above your subject; i think you could have got round this by doing a more wide-screen type crop, like 10mm above and below your subject; not sure this would be 160px though...  like it overall though, both conceptually and in execution. 7.', '2006-06-26 09:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554232, 353591, 16004, '<td valign="top">the colours, textures, feel, composition are all top notch here.  i''m pleased you made the sensible choice to have the cab moving in lieu of panning with it, those walls are brilliant.  i also like very much how the yellow lines are so bright and bold.  great choice of subject matter as well, genius in fact! 9.</td>', 'the colours, textures, feel, composition are all top notch here.  i''m pleased you made the sensible choice to have the cab moving in lieu of panning with it, those walls are brilliant.  i also like very much how the yellow lines are so bright and bold.  great choice of subject matter as well, genius in fact! 9.', '2006-06-26 09:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554241, 353410, 16004, '<td valign="top">10.  easy.  this is so captivating.  best bit is the slightly mad sense of scale; the trees look like models!  fits the challenge (the motion blur is there but in no way does it over power the shot), brilliantly taken, fantastically processed and presented.</td>', '10.  easy.  this is so captivating.  best bit is the slightly mad sense of scale; the trees look like models!  fits the challenge (the motion blur is there but in no way does it over power the shot), brilliantly taken, fantastically processed and presented.', '2006-06-26 09:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554256, 353408, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m getting sick just looking at it. LOL  The ol'' carnival ride. Nice colors here!!</td>', 'I''m getting sick just looking at it. LOL  The ol'' carnival ride. Nice colors here!!', '2006-06-26 09:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554257, 353625, 16004, '<td valign="top">aside from the fact that there isn''t any blur of any kind, i feel this picture suffers somewhat from the overpoweringly white background - i''m guessing you felt that the original background was too distracting, but this is too heavily applied a fix.  3.</td>', 'aside from the fact that there isn''t any blur of any kind, i feel this picture suffers somewhat from the overpoweringly white background - i''m guessing you felt that the original background was too distracting, but this is too heavily applied a fix.  3.', '2006-06-26 09:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554260, 351039, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. NOt sure if I sense motion, despite the fact that you focused on the boat and not the pilon. Hmmm - I do like the ocmposition and use of complementary blues and yellows. I''ll think on it and come back.</td>', 'This is interesting. NOt sure if I sense motion, despite the fact that you focused on the boat and not the pilon. Hmmm - I do like the ocmposition and use of complementary blues and yellows. I''ll think on it and come back.', '2006-06-26 09:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554261, 353323, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL Not an overly artistic shot, but VERY funny nonetheless. I think you should have called it MEATHEAD (an American reference to the son in "All in the Family." Thanks for the morning laugh.</td>', 'ROFL Not an overly artistic shot, but VERY funny nonetheless. I think you should have called it MEATHEAD (an American reference to the son in "All in the Family." Thanks for the morning laugh.', '2006-06-26 09:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554265, 353625, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the color contrast and the white background, but I sense no blur whatsoever. Fantastic composition otherwise.</td>', 'I love the color contrast and the white background, but I sense no blur whatsoever. Fantastic composition otherwise.', '2006-06-26 09:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554268, 352740, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this. Nicely composed and the green tones are very soothing against the palamino coloring of the horse. Her black jacket and boots show up well.  7</td>', 'I like this. Nicely composed and the green tones are very soothing against the palamino coloring of the horse. Her black jacket and boots show up well.  7', '2006-06-26 09:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554269, 353348, 16004, '<td valign="top">poor little bugger!  this is very sweet in a sick and funny kind of way, though the illusion is somewhat shattered by the fact that only one wheel is spinning (the front, oddly) and it all looks like it''s suspended in air.  if you cropped the shot 1mm above the bottom edge of the tyres (and spun the back wheel) i think it would probably be a top 5 contender.  6.</td>', 'poor little bugger!  this is very sweet in a sick and funny kind of way, though the illusion is somewhat shattered by the fact that only one wheel is spinning (the front, oddly) and it all looks like it''s suspended in air.  if you cropped the shot 1mm above the bottom edge of the tyres (and spun the back wheel) i think it would probably be a top 5 contender.  6.', '2006-06-26 09:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554270, 353161, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice color saturation. Unusual take on a road with lights PLUS moving water. I like it. 7</td>', 'Nice color saturation. Unusual take on a road with lights PLUS moving water. I like it. 7', '2006-06-26 09:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554271, 353198, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great abstract. Can''t wait to find out what it is. I sense some herringbone something in there. Great title.</td>', 'Great abstract. Can''t wait to find out what it is. I sense some herringbone something in there. Great title.', '2006-06-26 09:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554272, 349946, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lovely but I don''t sense enough blur to really have much motion impact. It''s simple and I like the composition.</td>', 'This is lovely but I don''t sense enough blur to really have much motion impact. It''s simple and I like the composition.', '2006-06-26 09:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554274, 353515, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect. I think I''s like him to be less centered but that''s just my taste. Nice use of white and red here.  Beautiful horse by the way. 7</td>', 'Very cool effect. I think I''s like him to be less centered but that''s just my taste. Nice use of white and red here.  Beautiful horse by the way. 7', '2006-06-26 09:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554276, 352294, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  This is funny!!!</td>', 'ROFL  This is funny!!!', '2006-06-26 09:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554278, 353015, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the urban sense.  The single red of the stop sign is nicely done and achieves an interesting look. The grid of the pavement/sidewalk adds nice texture to it. I like it.</td>', 'I like the urban sense.  The single red of the stop sign is nicely done and achieves an interesting look. The grid of the pavement/sidewalk adds nice texture to it. I like it.', '2006-06-26 09:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554279, 352736, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE THIS. What makes it realy jump out are the complementary colors.  This is soft and blurred, yet you can see exactly what''s going on. I like the white of the stripes on the black shoes (Adidas?)Very well done. My fav so far. 9</td>', 'LOVE THIS. What makes it realy jump out are the complementary colors.  This is soft and blurred, yet you can see exactly what''s going on. I like the white of the stripes on the black shoes (Adidas?)Very well done. My fav so far. 9', '2006-06-26 09:42:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2554283, 353520, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cool use of frames here.  I love the triptych effect very much. I hoe it does well for you. It''s lovely and you took a rather ordinary scene and made it quite outstanding. Great colors with the blue/gray, yellows and greens. Congrats on a job well done.</td>', 'Very cool use of frames here.  I love the triptych effect very much. I hoe it does well for you. It''s lovely and you took a rather ordinary scene and made it quite outstanding. Great colors with the blue/gray, yellows and greens. Congrats on a job well done.', '2006-06-26 09:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554285, 353649, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. Love the vibrancy. The flower almost looks like its metallic.</td>', 'This is beautiful. Love the vibrancy. The flower almost looks like its metallic.', '2006-06-26 09:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554288, 351942, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love her intense expression and the flowing part of her dress behind the shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love her intense expression and the flowing part of her dress behind the shot. Nicely done.', '2006-06-26 09:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554290, 353472, 15711, '<td valign="top">VERY COOL- I like the subtlety of it.  Great focus on her face and eyes. Love the freckles. The movement of her hair and earring is just enough to really work for the challenge.  Good job. 10</td>', 'VERY COOL- I like the subtlety of it.  Great focus on her face and eyes. Love the freckles. The movement of her hair and earring is just enough to really work for the challenge.  Good job. 10', '2006-06-26 09:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554292, 351272, 15711, '<td valign="top">I see this as stop action and not motion blur. IT seems a tad over sharp. Maybe it''s the lighting due to time of day. It''s a pretty scene.</td>', 'I see this as stop action and not motion blur. IT seems a tad over sharp. Maybe it''s the lighting due to time of day. It''s a pretty scene.', '2006-06-26 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554295, 353753, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I''d thought of doing something like this but didn''t. Glad you did - it''s lovely and the softening that the motion does to the colors is wonderful. I could look at this all day. 10</td>', 'I love this.  I''d thought of doing something like this but didn''t. Glad you did - it''s lovely and the softening that the motion does to the colors is wonderful. I could look at this all day. 10', '2006-06-26 09:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554297, 350166, 15711, '<td valign="top">Makes him look like he''s walking on air. Kinda cool.</td>', 'Makes him look like he''s walking on air. Kinda cool.', '2006-06-26 09:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554298, 353324, 16004, '<td valign="top">apart from the fact that most nuns i''ve seen are grey haired old biddies poodling around in honda civics at speeds that would make a motion blur shot impossible, this is quite creative.  i do feel that the poses feel a little forced and unconvincing (i think a spaced out nonchalant feet on the dashboard would suit the vw hippy lifestyle more), and to be honest, a tiny bit irritating.  also, i can''t help but think the shot is washed in slightly too much shade; especially for the nun in the dark at the back...  still, it''s an amusing idea and it''s nicely done.  7.<br/> <br/>lovely van, by the way.</td>', 'apart from the fact that most nuns i''ve seen are grey haired old biddies poodling around in honda civics at speeds that would make a motion blur shot impossible, this is quite creative.  i do feel that the poses feel a little forced and unconvincing (i think a spaced out nonchalant feet on the dashboard would suit the vw hippy lifestyle more), and to be honest, a tiny bit irritating.  also, i can''t help but think the shot is washed in slightly too much shade; especially for the nun in the dark at the back...  still, it''s an amusing idea and it''s nicely done.  7. lovely van, by the way.', '2006-06-26 09:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554299, 352512, 25355, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture, but I really think the border is totally unnecessary.</td>', 'Lovely picture, but I really think the border is totally unnecessary.', '2006-06-26 09:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554300, 353323, 29906, '<td valign="top">Motion Blur at its best ..</td>', 'Motion Blur at its best ..', '2006-06-26 09:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554302, 353459, 15711, '<td valign="top">Striking! Love the contrast and light.  What a terrific title. You get an extra point for that! Aw, heck, I''m just gonna give you a 10 - I love it.</td>', 'Striking! Love the contrast and light.  What a terrific title. You get an extra point for that! Aw, heck, I''m just gonna give you a 10 - I love it.', '2006-06-26 09:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554307, 352338, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just adore this.  Makes me think of the days when people didn''t have air conditioning. It''s tack sharp, with perfect placement.  It might not have the POW that some of the color shots do, but I really like it alot. It would make a great piece of art on a wall with a wide mat and simple black frame in an office, or contemporary setting.  Way to go. (I can almost hear it purring away).</td>', 'I just adore this.  Makes me think of the days when people didn''t have air conditioning. It''s tack sharp, with perfect placement.  It might not have the POW that some of the color shots do, but I really like it alot. It would make a great piece of art on a wall with a wide mat and simple black frame in an office, or contemporary setting.  Way to go. (I can almost hear it purring away).', '2006-06-26 09:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554309, 351741, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that I had to study it to figure out what was going on.  Well done. Even the centering works.</td>', 'I like the fact that I had to study it to figure out what was going on.  Well done. Even the centering works.', '2006-06-26 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554312, 353510, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is great.  Love their horns and the one black guy. What if you worked on the saturation of the green tones? This might be cool in black and white or sepia too. I like it. 8</td>', 'Oh this is great.  Love their horns and the one black guy. What if you worked on the saturation of the green tones? This might be cool in black and white or sepia too. I like it. 8', '2006-06-26 09:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554314, 353397, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE THIS. Great high key effect.  The grid of the floor tiles add a nice bit of geometry to the shot.  Maybe the most artful I''ve run across yet.  Bravo. 10</td>', 'LOVE THIS. Great high key effect.  The grid of the floor tiles add a nice bit of geometry to the shot.  Maybe the most artful I''ve run across yet.  Bravo. 10', '2006-06-26 09:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554317, 353671, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed. I like the faded quality of the background colors.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nicely composed. I like the faded quality of the background colors.  Good job.', '2006-06-26 09:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554318, 353743, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - very artsy.  I''d hang this on a wall.  Love it.</td>', 'WOW - very artsy.  I''d hang this on a wall.  Love it.', '2006-06-26 09:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554320, 353403, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice how the jogger is almost out of the frame.  Perfect blur. The blue of the guy''s hat and gloves really makes the shot. Well composed and executed. 10</td>', 'Nice how the jogger is almost out of the frame.  Perfect blur. The blue of the guy''s hat and gloves really makes the shot. Well composed and executed. 10', '2006-06-26 09:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554322, 353324, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  This is hilarious! Love the expressions, whether real of staged.  That Vanagan rocks.  Thanks for the chuckle.</td>', 'ROFL  This is hilarious! Love the expressions, whether real of staged.  That Vanagan rocks.  Thanks for the chuckle.', '2006-06-26 09:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554324, 353642, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich tones. I like it.</td>', 'Beautiful rich tones. I like it.', '2006-06-26 09:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554326, 353409, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this but I think the crop is too tight I''d like it if you were panned back and we could see more of the road/countryside.</td>', 'I like this but I think the crop is too tight I''d like it if you were panned back and we could see more of the road/countryside.', '2006-06-26 09:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554330, 353663, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cute but I sense bokeh and not motion.</td>', 'Cute but I sense bokeh and not motion.', '2006-06-26 10:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554331, 353215, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH MY GOODNESS! This is my kind of shot.  Simple and minimalistic with lots of negative space.  Wonderful capture. 10</td>', 'OH MY GOODNESS! This is my kind of shot.  Simple and minimalistic with lots of negative space.  Wonderful capture. 10', '2006-06-26 10:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554333, 353154, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice city shot.  Wonderful yellow and green tones with that pop of red. Well done.</td>', 'Nice city shot.  Wonderful yellow and green tones with that pop of red. Well done.', '2006-06-26 10:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554334, 353306, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH how fun.  This has a susi quality to it.  Love the vibrant indigo color of her skirt. Nicely composed too. Great image. 10</td>', 'OH how fun.  This has a susi quality to it.  Love the vibrant indigo color of her skirt. Nicely composed too. Great image. 10', '2006-06-26 10:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554338, 352512, 15711, '<td valign="top">Of all the blurred water, this has the most interest to me. Partially for the perspective, and secondly, that bit of green with the fern fronds down on the right. Love the frame too. Beautiful.</td>', 'Of all the blurred water, this has the most interest to me. Partially for the perspective, and secondly, that bit of green with the fern fronds down on the right. Love the frame too. Beautiful.', '2006-06-26 10:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554342, 353558, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.</td>', 'Love the colors.', '2006-06-26 10:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554345, 353406, 15711, '<td valign="top">Adorable. Love that her right foot is almost invisible.  Nicely done and unusual. Love the title too. If I were to change anything, I might have her less centered. 8</td>', 'Adorable. Love that her right foot is almost invisible.  Nicely done and unusual. Love the title too. If I were to change anything, I might have her less centered. 8', '2006-06-26 10:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554347, 353754, 15711, '<td valign="top">PRETTY!!!!I like what the light does to those colors against the black. Well done.</td>', 'PRETTY!!!!I like what the light does to those colors against the black. Well done.', '2006-06-26 10:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554351, 353734, 22781, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2006-06-26 10:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554353, 353297, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - reminiscent of that old sonifo image from a challenge a year ago. Great movement and colors.  This is fun!  Good one.</td>', 'HEE HEE - reminiscent of that old sonifo image from a challenge a year ago. Great movement and colors.  This is fun!  Good one.', '2006-06-26 10:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554357, 351895, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is great. I love how he is framed by the moving train. Him being "centered" is not only literal but symbolic as well.  Nicely done. 8</td>', 'Oh this is great. I love how he is framed by the moving train. Him being "centered" is not only literal but symbolic as well.  Nicely done. 8', '2006-06-26 10:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554359, 353625, 47704, '<td valign="top">Where''s the blur?</td>', 'Where''s the blur?', '2006-06-26 10:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554360, 353742, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of sick of waterfalls, but this is very lovely.  The glistening rocks really make it for me.</td>', 'I''m kind of sick of waterfalls, but this is very lovely.  The glistening rocks really make it for me.', '2006-06-26 10:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554364, 353219, 15711, '<td valign="top">THIS IS GREAT. Love the use of black and white.  Wonderful contrast. 8</td>', 'THIS IS GREAT. Love the use of black and white.  Wonderful contrast. 8', '2006-06-26 10:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554365, 353520, 47704, '<td valign="top">This would have been a good pic without the frames.</td>', 'This would have been a good pic without the frames.', '2006-06-26 10:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554368, 353740, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cool and abstract.</td>', 'Cool and abstract.', '2006-06-26 10:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554378, 353569, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE THIS.  Great for the challenge. Nicely composed with the balance of the frisbee and the dog.  BRAVO 10</td>', 'LOVE THIS.  Great for the challenge. Nicely composed with the balance of the frisbee and the dog.  BRAVO 10', '2006-06-26 10:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554383, 353746, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Good use of desat too. His expression is hilarious. In a perfect scenario, the brick wall would be gone and he''d have no tag on his shirt, but the NIkE check would be cool. You could call it "Just Do It." LOL</td>', 'Nicely done.  Good use of desat too. His expression is hilarious. In a perfect scenario, the brick wall would be gone and he''d have no tag on his shirt, but the NIkE check would be cool. You could call it "Just Do It." LOL', '2006-06-26 10:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554398, 350166, 21714, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Looks like a dream. Almost up there in the clouds.</td>', 'Cool shot. Looks like a dream. Almost up there in the clouds.', '2006-06-26 10:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554406, 353306, 21714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.<br/>I think the processing is a bit harsh though. I would have liked it softer (just as opinion).</td>', 'Wonderful shot.I think the processing is a bit harsh though. I would have liked it softer (just as opinion).', '2006-06-26 10:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
