(2554709, 351911, 51538, '<td valign="top">Quite nice.  Tones are very nice.  I wonder if a tiny adjustment to shutter speed would have put the rider in sharper focus while still maintaining blur on the horse''s legs.  Easier said than done, no doubt.  Just a thought.  I like to have some sort of stasis in a motion picture by way of counterpoint.</td>', 'Quite nice.  Tones are very nice.  I wonder if a tiny adjustment to shutter speed would have put the rider in sharper focus while still maintaining blur on the horse''s legs.  Easier said than done, no doubt.  Just a thought.  I like to have some sort of stasis in a motion picture by way of counterpoint.', '2006-06-26 12:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
