(2554721, 353656, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, textures and colours.  Water is certainly fluid.  Wood is wonderful, as regards shape.  I might have been tempted to concentrate on the wood and exclude the broken sandbag.</td>', 'Nice tones, textures and colours.  Water is certainly fluid.  Wood is wonderful, as regards shape.  I might have been tempted to concentrate on the wood and exclude the broken sandbag.', '2006-06-26 12:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
