(2554729, 353323, 51538, '<td valign="top">You look innocent - if you are the male.  Not a beer can in sight either.  If you''re the lady, then I suppose it was his stoic nature that finally enraged you.  Hopefully, this photo is not going to be subpoenaed.</td>', 'You look innocent - if you are the male.  Not a beer can in sight either.  If you''re the lady, then I suppose it was his stoic nature that finally enraged you.  Hopefully, this photo is not going to be subpoenaed.', '2006-06-26 12:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
