(2554744, 352528, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.  Harsh midday light, by the looks of it.  But you did well to control all the aspects of light and speed in the photo.</td>', 'Nice focus.  Harsh midday light, by the looks of it.  But you did well to control all the aspects of light and speed in the photo.', '2006-06-26 12:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554745, 353730, 18367, '<td valign="top">Best image I have seen so far. This almost borders on impressionism, and has a Shapiro quality to it. Don''t know who Shapiro is... visit his profile on DPC... a truly gifted photographer who is reknowned for this genre of images.</td>', 'Best image I have seen so far. This almost borders on impressionism, and has a Shapiro quality to it. Don''t know who Shapiro is... visit his profile on DPC... a truly gifted photographer who is reknowned for this genre of images.', '2006-06-26 12:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
