(2554749, 353389, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the counterpoint of stasis and motion.  Nicely done under, I assume, difficult circumstances.</td>', 'I like the counterpoint of stasis and motion.  Nicely done under, I assume, difficult circumstances.', '2006-06-26 13:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554751, 353739, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice warm colours.  The one hand moving and the other still is a nice way of composing the image.</td>', 'Nice warm colours.  The one hand moving and the other still is a nice way of composing the image.', '2006-06-26 13:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554755, 352486, 51538, '<td valign="top">Up to a certain point, a photo of moving water is enhanced by long shutter speed.  After that point, it gets - IMO - more and more ethereal and becomes something else.  This photo is in the zone of something else.  Sorry for my poor description, but hope you get what I mean.  I think there could be something added to this image to make it quite special.</td>', 'Up to a certain point, a photo of moving water is enhanced by long shutter speed.  After that point, it gets - IMO - more and more ethereal and becomes something else.  This photo is in the zone of something else.  Sorry for my poor description, but hope you get what I mean.  I think there could be something added to this image to make it quite special.', '2006-06-26 13:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554757, 353704, 51538, '<td valign="top">Linear in all aspects and it is lines which infer motion.  Nice focus.</td>', 'Linear in all aspects and it is lines which infer motion.  Nice focus.', '2006-06-26 13:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554761, 353370, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the processing of this and the intersection.  Stasis and motion are both in the photo, each enhancing the other.  I think this is greyscale gradient editing - but probably wrong.  It is fascinating the effect.  I tend toward playing with the colouring of this and adjusting to the more blue or grey/black colours myself.  Nice work. 8.</td>', 'I like the processing of this and the intersection.  Stasis and motion are both in the photo, each enhancing the other.  I think this is greyscale gradient editing - but probably wrong.  It is fascinating the effect.  I tend toward playing with the colouring of this and adjusting to the more blue or grey/black colours myself.  Nice work. 8.', '2006-06-26 13:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2554764, 353511, 51538, '<td valign="top">Almost like computer-generated graphics - but obviously not.  It is a great idea and very well executed. 7.</td>', 'Almost like computer-generated graphics - but obviously not.  It is a great idea and very well executed. 7.', '2006-06-26 13:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
