(2555062, 353488, 42100, '<td valign="top">Super sweet motion blur, creates a strong feel of speed.  Also like the contrast of the race car with its surroundings.  Ofcourse, having a Ferrari in your photo is never a bad thing!</td>', 'Super sweet motion blur, creates a strong feel of speed.  Also like the contrast of the race car with its surroundings.  Ofcourse, having a Ferrari in your photo is never a bad thing!', '2006-06-26 14:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
