(2555149, 353012, 42100, '<td valign="top">Strong splash of color in this photo, reaches right out and grabs you by the collar.  Good composition as well.  Very nice!</td>', 'Strong splash of color in this photo, reaches right out and grabs you by the collar.  Good composition as well.  Very nice!', '2006-06-26 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
