(2555156, 352846, 42100, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and composition of this one, and you managed to catch the intensity in the eyes.  I imagine that''s a tought thing  to do in this type of photo!  Great photo!</td>', 'I like the angle and composition of this one, and you managed to catch the intensity in the eyes.  I imagine that''s a tought thing  to do in this type of photo!  Great photo!', '2006-06-26 15:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
