(2555184, 353488, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Very nice!  Good use of angle in this case to add additional interest to the image.</td>', 'Yep.  Very nice!  Good use of angle in this case to add additional interest to the image.', '2006-06-26 15:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
