(2556119, 353384, 51538, '<td valign="top">This is a very dramatic - and symbolic - photo.  The exposure seems to be perfect. 8.</td>', 'This is a very dramatic - and symbolic - photo.  The exposure seems to be perfect. 8.', '2006-06-26 21:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
