(2556134, 353496, 51538, '<td valign="top">Oh yes!  He? has velocity and you captured it.  Glad to see the camera survive too. ;-)</td>', 'Oh yes!  He? has velocity and you captured it.  Glad to see the camera survive too. ;-)', '2006-06-26 21:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556137, 353383, 51538, '<td valign="top">Now that is an interesting idea and modern too.  The only criticism I have is that most of the people I see with cell phones in NYC have them permantly cemented to their ears. No apparent motion there.  ;-)</td>', 'Now that is an interesting idea and modern too.  The only criticism I have is that most of the people I see with cell phones in NYC have them permantly cemented to their ears. No apparent motion there.  ;-)', '2006-06-26 21:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556139, 350052, 23053, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on the challenge.  The shot almost looks like it was shot with a lens baby, the way that the central flowers are almost still and those on the edges are blurred.  While the blurred flowers do add a sense of motion to the shot, there is still an over-all static feel to the shot.  Since no two flower pictures will be the same - especially if they are moving - it may be worthwhile to look at different compositions to see if a more pleasing arrangement can be found.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is an interesting take on the challenge.  The shot almost looks like it was shot with a lens baby, the way that the central flowers are almost still and those on the edges are blurred.  While the blurred flowers do add a sense of motion to the shot, there is still an over-all static feel to the shot.  Since no two flower pictures will be the same - especially if they are moving - it may be worthwhile to look at different compositions to see if a more pleasing arrangement can be found.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-26 21:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556143, 351741, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the sky, the left and middle figures.  But I cannot quite figure out what the right hand thing is.  I wish it was not there since it only takes away from this image.  I must be missing something, right?  Your idea of a peacefully composed mediating person on a rock surrounded by moving people is superb though.  Could have been a real winner and, IMO, worth reshooting.</td>', 'I like the sky, the left and middle figures.  But I cannot quite figure out what the right hand thing is.  I wish it was not there since it only takes away from this image.  I must be missing something, right?  Your idea of a peacefully composed mediating person on a rock surrounded by moving people is superb though.  Could have been a real winner and, IMO, worth reshooting.', '2006-06-26 21:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556147, 352819, 51538, '<td valign="top">It is amazing how moving bikes take on a sort of weightless, delicate, hurtling feel when motion panning is applied.</td>', 'It is amazing how moving bikes take on a sort of weightless, delicate, hurtling feel when motion panning is applied.', '2006-06-26 21:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556148, 353367, 23053, '<td valign="top">This is almost more digital art than digital photography...not necessarily a bad thing at all.  This is mostly a study in color and shape, and while most everyone would recognize the flower, it is not a typical flower portrait by any means.  The colors are amazing, and there is a lot to look at.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is almost more digital art than digital photography...not necessarily a bad thing at all.  This is mostly a study in color and shape, and while most everyone would recognize the flower, it is not a typical flower portrait by any means.  The colors are amazing, and there is a lot to look at.  Good luck.', '2006-06-26 21:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556149, 353283, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice uninterupted subject.  Good focus.</td>', 'Nice uninterupted subject.  Good focus.', '2006-06-26 21:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556154, 353351, 51538, '<td valign="top">I''m glad I read the title.  Now I can see the girl.  They used to do that in the old days, right?  Amazing way to earn a living.  I wish there was a crisp, stop-action shutter/focus on this subject.  I know, I know, it''s about motion.  But the subject is so interesting one wants a good close look-see.</td>', 'I''m glad I read the title.  Now I can see the girl.  They used to do that in the old days, right?  Amazing way to earn a living.  I wish there was a crisp, stop-action shutter/focus on this subject.  I know, I know, it''s about motion.  But the subject is so interesting one wants a good close look-see.', '2006-06-26 21:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556159, 351544, 51538, '<td valign="top">I bet those river boats must have looked wonderful in the days before electricty when they were candle and oil lamp lit.</td>', 'I bet those river boats must have looked wonderful in the days before electricty when they were candle and oil lamp lit.', '2006-06-26 21:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556161, 353701, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice story and good idea.  Effects a picture of motion very well.  I expect better lighting might have made the subject pop a little.</td>', 'Nice story and good idea.  Effects a picture of motion very well.  I expect better lighting might have made the subject pop a little.', '2006-06-26 21:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556164, 352378, 51538, '<td valign="top">Close to my screen this image does nothing.  I step back a pace or two across the room and this really does pop.  In fact, it is dramatic. 7.</td>', 'Close to my screen this image does nothing.  I step back a pace or two across the room and this really does pop.  In fact, it is dramatic. 7.', '2006-06-26 21:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556170, 353296, 51538, '<td valign="top">First time through I skipped by this.  Second time, I come to a stop.  This is a subtle image.  I like the tones a lot.  The more I look, the more I like. 7.</td>', 'First time through I skipped by this.  Second time, I come to a stop.  This is a subtle image.  I like the tones a lot.  The more I look, the more I like. 7.', '2006-06-26 21:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556183, 351587, 51538, '<td valign="top">The suburbs are spooky places!  City-mouse speaking here.  This is a surreal image in a way.  Is that the moon?  I wish it was not quite so bright and wish the human was, say, on a bike with red tail light receding into the distance.  Somehow, this had potential and needs a little help.</td>', 'The suburbs are spooky places!  City-mouse speaking here.  This is a surreal image in a way.  Is that the moon?  I wish it was not quite so bright and wish the human was, say, on a bike with red tail light receding into the distance.  Somehow, this had potential and needs a little help.', '2006-06-26 21:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556189, 353592, 51538, '<td valign="top">This subject is a very good idea.  I could image several of these little creatures wound up and running this way and that.  It would take some planning and composition.</td>', 'This subject is a very good idea.  I could image several of these little creatures wound up and running this way and that.  It would take some planning and composition.', '2006-06-26 22:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556249, 351741, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The sky and the grass have come out great.  I like the idea.  The only thing I am not too sure about is the big black rock, but even that has texture and isn''t just a mass of black.  Overall I think it''s really good, and if I were voting I would give it a 9.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this.  The sky and the grass have come out great.  I like the idea.  The only thing I am not too sure about is the big black rock, but even that has texture and isn''t just a mass of black.  Overall I think it''s really good, and if I were voting I would give it a 9.  Good luck.', '2006-06-26 22:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556255, 352731, 36382, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred the person walking towards the camera.  I like the feeling of the picture.  It definitely conveys that scarey feeling of being alone in an alley at night.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred the person walking towards the camera.  I like the feeling of the picture.  It definitely conveys that scarey feeling of being alone in an alley at night.', '2006-06-26 22:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
