(2556738, 353730, 24983, '<td valign="top">love this 10</td>', 'love this 10', '2006-06-27 01:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556769, 353440, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is just gorgeous!!!  Such crystal clear focus on his head.  One of the best hummingbird shots I''ve ever seen.  10</td>', 'This is just gorgeous!!!  Such crystal clear focus on his head.  One of the best hummingbird shots I''ve ever seen.  10', '2006-06-27 01:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556772, 352846, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is just amazing...  Perfect!  10</td>', 'This is just amazing...  Perfect!  10', '2006-06-27 01:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556780, 353496, 24983, '<td valign="top">excellent shot 10</td>', 'excellent shot 10', '2006-06-27 01:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556901, 351895, 55738, '<td valign="top">Great timing to get this so symmetrical. Excellent!</td>', 'Great timing to get this so symmetrical. Excellent!', '2006-06-27 01:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556902, 353336, 55738, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  great motion panning.</td>', 'Neat shot!  great motion panning.', '2006-06-27 01:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556910, 353388, 55738, '<td valign="top">Excellent motion panning.</td>', 'Excellent motion panning.', '2006-06-27 01:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556912, 351942, 55738, '<td valign="top">Her perfectly focused face is fantastic!</td>', 'Her perfectly focused face is fantastic!', '2006-06-27 02:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556921, 353328, 55738, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure where the motion blur is here.  Sorry.</td>', 'I''m not sure where the motion blur is here.  Sorry.', '2006-06-27 02:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556922, 353625, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, but I''m just not really seeing motion blur. Sorry.</td>', 'This is a great shot, but I''m just not really seeing motion blur. Sorry.', '2006-06-27 02:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556942, 353215, 31403, '<td valign="top">crop right down to that - we don''t need all that blur to prove you did it - the deer is the cool part, a MUCH tighter crop would make this very strong IMO - maybe angle it a little, the crop, so the blurs are forming angles?</td>', 'crop right down to that - we don''t need all that blur to prove you did it - the deer is the cool part, a MUCH tighter crop would make this very strong IMO - maybe angle it a little, the crop, so the blurs are forming angles?', '2006-06-27 02:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556948, 351895, 31403, '<td valign="top">so unexpected - love this - maybe crop it down just a little so the subject is more predominant - excellent creative though! 7</td>', 'so unexpected - love this - maybe crop it down just a little so the subject is more predominant - excellent creative though! 7', '2006-06-27 02:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556952, 353406, 55738, '<td valign="top">I think this is a beautiful shot, but I don''t like the title.  (Don''t worry I''m not scoring you on that!)  I just think that this photo could say a lot more than just the girl making an entrance.  It''s a much more delicate shot than that, imho.  Maybe something about dancing. Anyway, it''s a great shot.</td>', 'I think this is a beautiful shot, but I don''t like the title.  (Don''t worry I''m not scoring you on that!)  I just think that this photo could say a lot more than just the girl making an entrance.  It''s a much more delicate shot than that, imho.  Maybe something about dancing. Anyway, it''s a great shot.', '2006-06-27 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556953, 353663, 55738, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the chicken''s face.</td>', 'I wish I could see the chicken''s face.', '2006-06-27 02:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556955, 353464, 31403, '<td valign="top">why black and white?  because the overexposure made the fireworks go all the way to white is my guess - I find the light poles and the silo of the street sign distracting - could have been easily cropped out - but the huge overexposure and the black and white when I know there was spectacular color if I was there really hurt this for me.  3</td>', 'why black and white?  because the overexposure made the fireworks go all the way to white is my guess - I find the light poles and the silo of the street sign distracting - could have been easily cropped out - but the huge overexposure and the black and white when I know there was spectacular color if I was there really hurt this for me.  3', '2006-06-27 02:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556957, 353348, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious!</td>', 'This is hilarious!', '2006-06-27 02:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556960, 353202, 31403, '<td valign="top">the blur tells the story, that''s for sure.  I wonder if you could crop the top third of this vertically and have a stronger photo.  Just a thought -</td>', 'the blur tells the story, that''s for sure.  I wonder if you could crop the top third of this vertically and have a stronger photo.  Just a thought -', '2006-06-27 02:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556966, 353375, 31403, '<td valign="top">would love to see more dimension in this - my thought is this - this is the angle we all look at elliptical machines with - so the photo doesn''t grab your audience because this is what we see all the time!  What if the camera was wide angle on the floor right under the Precor logo looking up - we see more of the machine, distorted from the lens, we see the bottom part of the torso of the subject, it''s a different angle so it intrigues us, shows us our world from a different place.  I''m not saying that is THE shot, but just an example of a different perspective with more dimension, more interesting lines.  Hope that helps.</td>', 'would love to see more dimension in this - my thought is this - this is the angle we all look at elliptical machines with - so the photo doesn''t grab your audience because this is what we see all the time!  What if the camera was wide angle on the floor right under the Precor logo looking up - we see more of the machine, distorted from the lens, we see the bottom part of the torso of the subject, it''s a different angle so it intrigues us, shows us our world from a different place.  I''m not saying that is THE shot, but just an example of a different perspective with more dimension, more interesting lines.  Hope that helps.', '2006-06-27 02:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556972, 351039, 31403, '<td valign="top">nice photo of a boat on the lake, but a pole got in the way!<br/> <br/>I know it''s your blur element, but it feels like a mistake compositionally, something that should have been cropped out.  <br/> <br/>4</td>', 'nice photo of a boat on the lake, but a pole got in the way! I know it''s your blur element, but it feels like a mistake compositionally, something that should have been cropped out.   4', '2006-06-27 02:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556976, 353146, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh, this is opposite from what I hoped from the thumbnail!  Blur those flowers and keep that bee in focus and you''ve got a SHOT!!<br/> <br/>As it is, it kind of looks like a mistake - your main subject is blurred - a big problem in most photography. I appreciate you trying to justify it with the title, but a blurred subject when all else is in focus looks like a mistake to me - 3</td>', 'oh, this is opposite from what I hoped from the thumbnail!  Blur those flowers and keep that bee in focus and you''ve got a SHOT!! As it is, it kind of looks like a mistake - your main subject is blurred - a big problem in most photography. I appreciate you trying to justify it with the title, but a blurred subject when all else is in focus looks like a mistake to me - 3', '2006-06-27 02:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556977, 353005, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''m interested in how you shot this.  Like the originality of the processing.  If the camera was tilted so the road''s leading lines formed more of an angle I wonder if it would be better - just a thought.  Nice work though - hope you described the shooting in your comments.</td>', 'I''m interested in how you shot this.  Like the originality of the processing.  If the camera was tilted so the road''s leading lines formed more of an angle I wonder if it would be better - just a thought.  Nice work though - hope you described the shooting in your comments.', '2006-06-27 02:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556978, 353743, 60862, '<td valign="top">This looked very nice in the thumbnail, but in large form the horse isn''t sharp.</td>', 'This looked very nice in the thumbnail, but in large form the horse isn''t sharp.', '2006-06-27 02:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556979, 349946, 60862, '<td valign="top">Where''s the motion?</td>', 'Where''s the motion?', '2006-06-27 02:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556980, 353704, 31403, '<td valign="top">Crop right down there - all that blur isn''t really adding to the photo IMO - maybe an angled crop to break up all those horizontal lines?  Having tried to shoot these cars I appreciate how difficult this actually is - it''s really nice work.</td>', 'Crop right down there - all that blur isn''t really adding to the photo IMO - maybe an angled crop to break up all those horizontal lines?  Having tried to shoot these cars I appreciate how difficult this actually is - it''s really nice work.', '2006-06-27 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556981, 351039, 60862, '<td valign="top">This seems to have the motion coming from something that''s not the main subject, and distracts me.</td>', 'This seems to have the motion coming from something that''s not the main subject, and distracts me.', '2006-06-27 02:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556982, 353625, 60862, '<td valign="top">Don''t see the motion ...</td>', 'Don''t see the motion ...', '2006-06-27 02:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556983, 353468, 60862, '<td valign="top">Don''t get what this is, or where I''m supposed to look.</td>', 'Don''t get what this is, or where I''m supposed to look.', '2006-06-27 02:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556984, 353304, 60862, '<td valign="top">Cute, but not especially compelling.</td>', 'Cute, but not especially compelling.', '2006-06-27 02:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556985, 353488, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh messy goodness!  I love this look but I''m betting DPC voters don''t in general.  The black masking the hood is really too bad here, but love the worn-out magic marker effect the blur has given.</td>', 'oh messy goodness!  I love this look but I''m betting DPC voters don''t in general.  The black masking the hood is really too bad here, but love the worn-out magic marker effect the blur has given.', '2006-06-27 02:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556986, 353520, 60862, '<td valign="top">I didn''t really get this.  Why were the three frames chosen?  It might''ve been a lovely shot without all of the frames.</td>', 'I didn''t really get this.  Why were the three frames chosen?  It might''ve been a lovely shot without all of the frames.', '2006-06-27 02:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556987, 353654, 60862, '<td valign="top">This seems like more of a long shot than a motion blur shot.</td>', 'This seems like more of a long shot than a motion blur shot.', '2006-06-27 02:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556989, 353737, 60862, '<td valign="top">Yes, it has motion blur, but it''s not that visually interesting.</td>', 'Yes, it has motion blur, but it''s not that visually interesting.', '2006-06-27 02:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556991, 351382, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the right side image is too faded.  Also, I found the blurry lights on the horizon distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the right side image is too faded.  Also, I found the blurry lights on the horizon distracting.', '2006-06-27 02:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556992, 353663, 60862, '<td valign="top">I guess this is supposed to be funy, but where''s the motion?  If it''s the streak to the left, it could be better a little brighter.</td>', 'I guess this is supposed to be funy, but where''s the motion?  If it''s the streak to the left, it could be better a little brighter.', '2006-06-27 02:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556993, 353517, 31403, '<td valign="top">very interesting - the thumbnail made me think of something organic - like through a microscope.  Interesting how the reflections gave "scratches" to the trail - nice creative - I wonder if more coins would be better to break up the oppresive black in the photo?</td>', 'very interesting - the thumbnail made me think of something organic - like through a microscope.  Interesting how the reflections gave "scratches" to the trail - nice creative - I wonder if more coins would be better to break up the oppresive black in the photo?', '2006-06-27 02:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556994, 350223, 60862, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Motion blur.  Not much else to say, though.</td>', 'Yep.  Motion blur.  Not much else to say, though.', '2006-06-27 02:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556995, 353446, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape, but motion blur?</td>', 'Beautiful landscape, but motion blur?', '2006-06-27 02:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2556999, 352736, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but without a clear, sharp background to set the action against, it all kind of blurs together.</td>', 'Nice idea, but without a clear, sharp background to set the action against, it all kind of blurs together.', '2006-06-27 02:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557002, 353098, 60862, '<td valign="top">Yep. Motion blur.  But not much about it is too interesting.</td>', 'Yep. Motion blur.  But not much about it is too interesting.', '2006-06-27 02:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557004, 351911, 60862, '<td valign="top">Either the subject or the background should be blurred, but not both.</td>', 'Either the subject or the background should be blurred, but not both.', '2006-06-27 02:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557005, 353592, 31403, '<td valign="top">I find the box and the other toy really distracting from the main point here.  I think you''re going for the toy escaping from the box?  Darker background to bring attention to the motion of the toy (visually speaking, light toy dark background, you know?)<br/> <br/>This is a great idea - I like the creative a lot.  Keep shooting this idea and working with it - there''s a great photo in there!</td>', 'I find the box and the other toy really distracting from the main point here.  I think you''re going for the toy escaping from the box?  Darker background to bring attention to the motion of the toy (visually speaking, light toy dark background, you know?) This is a great idea - I like the creative a lot.  Keep shooting this idea and working with it - there''s a great photo in there!', '2006-06-27 02:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557006, 353198, 60862, '<td valign="top">As a pic conveying motion, I''m not getting it.  As an abstract, I''m not getting it either.</td>', 'As a pic conveying motion, I''m not getting it.  As an abstract, I''m not getting it either.', '2006-06-27 02:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557007, 353625, 31403, '<td valign="top">really interesting image - no blur - sorry - 2</td>', 'really interesting image - no blur - sorry - 2', '2006-06-27 02:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557010, 353438, 60862, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I''m not sure this type of picture is going to work.  It comes across as just a blurred bee, as opposed to the motion blur conveying something.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I''m not sure this type of picture is going to work.  It comes across as just a blurred bee, as opposed to the motion blur conveying something.', '2006-06-27 02:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557011, 353464, 60862, '<td valign="top">Too washed out.  Were you trying to go for streaks of light?</td>', 'Too washed out.  Were you trying to go for streaks of light?', '2006-06-27 02:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557012, 353297, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  Nice, sharp subject, and the background is stable, too.  Conveys the insanity of kids out of control very well. :)  10.</td>', 'Hilarious!  Nice, sharp subject, and the background is stable, too.  Conveys the insanity of kids out of control very well. :)  10.', '2006-06-27 02:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557013, 353119, 31403, '<td valign="top">not sure what it is but it''s interesting.  I find myself wondering more about what the reflection is than enjoying the photo - maybe something more abstract in the reflection - or focus somewhere else in the image?  Love the abstract nature of this though</td>', 'not sure what it is but it''s interesting.  I find myself wondering more about what the reflection is than enjoying the photo - maybe something more abstract in the reflection - or focus somewhere else in the image?  Love the abstract nature of this though', '2006-06-27 02:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557015, 353393, 60862, '<td valign="top">Mediocre break, but beautiful shot conveying sharp static images and blurred moving ones.  The rail in the lower right is distracting, but the diagonal angle is less so.  The rail in the upper right, on the other hand, is just distracting.  Maybe you could''ve pulled the cue ball closer so you could''ve cropped it out?  Those are nitpicks, though;  I''m voting 9. :)</td>', 'Mediocre break, but beautiful shot conveying sharp static images and blurred moving ones.  The rail in the lower right is distracting, but the diagonal angle is less so.  The rail in the upper right, on the other hand, is just distracting.  Maybe you could''ve pulled the cue ball closer so you could''ve cropped it out?  Those are nitpicks, though;  I''m voting 9. :)', '2006-06-27 02:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557020, 352984, 60862, '<td valign="top">For a "found" shot as opposed to a staged one, this does a great job of conveying speed near a still person.  And the color contrast is very nice.  Just wish his right hand had been sharper.   Still a 9. :)</td>', 'For a "found" shot as opposed to a staged one, this does a great job of conveying speed near a still person.  And the color contrast is very nice.  Just wish his right hand had been sharper.   Still a 9. :)', '2006-06-27 02:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557021, 353440, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh my, THAT is hard to do!  My hat''s off to you for the sheer technical firepower here. The background being so plain hurts this from a compositional standpoint - but MAN, WHAT A SHOT!  7</td>', 'oh my, THAT is hard to do!  My hat''s off to you for the sheer technical firepower here. The background being so plain hurts this from a compositional standpoint - but MAN, WHAT A SHOT!  7', '2006-06-27 02:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557023, 351895, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow - nice timing to get the great color background.  This shot really conveys the contrast between calm and motion.  Even the blue to the sides of the brighter-colored bits of train draw your eye inward to the main subject/background.  A 10!</td>', 'Wow - nice timing to get the great color background.  This shot really conveys the contrast between calm and motion.  Even the blue to the sides of the brighter-colored bits of train draw your eye inward to the main subject/background.  A 10!', '2006-06-27 02:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557024, 353137, 60862, '<td valign="top">Really conveys both speed and how much he''s leaning over.  10.</td>', 'Really conveys both speed and how much he''s leaning over.  10.', '2006-06-27 02:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557025, 352846, 31403, '<td valign="top">you''re motorcycle is better than mine - wish I had a motoGP in town this week!  :-D  9  Enjoy your ribbon!</td>', 'you''re motorcycle is better than mine - wish I had a motoGP in town this week!  :-D  9  Enjoy your ribbon!', '2006-06-27 02:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557026, 353746, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, both for its look and for its being different from the others.  The selective color appeals to me, too.  I just wish the shadow on his chest weren''t there.  Still, a 9.</td>', 'I really like this shot, both for its look and for its being different from the others.  The selective color appeals to me, too.  I just wish the shadow on his chest weren''t there.  Still, a 9.', '2006-06-27 02:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557028, 353514, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh that''s pretty!  Love the colors!  9</td>', 'oh that''s pretty!  Love the colors!  9', '2006-06-27 02:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557029, 353348, 55767, '<td valign="top">very creative! LOL ... I love it!</td>', 'very creative! LOL ... I love it!', '2006-06-27 02:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557030, 353263, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very pretty use of the motion to create a pinwheel and I like the diagonal angle.  My one nitpick is to have made "Diving Bell" clearer.  Still, a 9!</td>', 'Very pretty use of the motion to create a pinwheel and I like the diagonal angle.  My one nitpick is to have made "Diving Bell" clearer.  Still, a 9!', '2006-06-27 02:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557032, 353569, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fun!  The look of total concentration on the dog''s face brought this up from a 7 to 8.</td>', 'Fun!  The look of total concentration on the dog''s face brought this up from a 7 to 8.', '2006-06-27 02:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557041, 353741, 60862, '<td valign="top">The look on her face is priceless, and you did a good job of using the motion blur as a storytelling element.  The colors are kind of washed out, though, and the cropping is so tight her face is a little too high.  Still, a 7!</td>', 'The look on her face is priceless, and you did a good job of using the motion blur as a storytelling element.  The colors are kind of washed out, though, and the cropping is so tight her face is a little too high.  Still, a 7!', '2006-06-27 02:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557042, 352467, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the empty space on the left is doing this much good - I''d prefer to see it (the empty space) cropped to about a third of what you''ve got there.  The tones in this are excellent - love teh processing.  Maybe just a skoosh more contrast?  Print it on excellent paper, put a big white matte on it with a sleek black frame and hang it somewhere where lots of people can see it - it''s art! 8</td>', 'I''m not sure the empty space on the left is doing this much good - I''d prefer to see it (the empty space) cropped to about a third of what you''ve got there.  The tones in this are excellent - love teh processing.  Maybe just a skoosh more contrast?  Print it on excellent paper, put a big white matte on it with a sleek black frame and hang it somewhere where lots of people can see it - it''s art! 8', '2006-06-27 02:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557046, 352819, 60862, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand how the title relates, but I like this shot very much.  You framed it well, with him riding into the picture, and panned very well as he went by.  7.</td>', 'I don''t understand how the title relates, but I like this shot very much.  You framed it well, with him riding into the picture, and panned very well as he went by.  7.', '2006-06-27 02:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557047, 349735, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of zooming!  I hope you''ll tell us how you did it. 9.</td>', 'Very nice use of zooming!  I hope you''ll tell us how you did it. 9.', '2006-06-27 02:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557052, 353348, 31403, '<td valign="top">funny!  cropping so we don''t see the bottom of the tires might strengthen the illusion - well, and a spinning back tire!  As I think about shooting something like this - I think I''d need two or three assistants and a snail wrangler!  So I appreciate how difficult this shot was to get - but just a little more work and it would be a contender!  6</td>', 'funny!  cropping so we don''t see the bottom of the tires might strengthen the illusion - well, and a spinning back tire!  As I think about shooting something like this - I think I''d need two or three assistants and a snail wrangler!  So I appreciate how difficult this shot was to get - but just a little more work and it would be a contender!  6', '2006-06-27 02:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557060, 353740, 31403, '<td valign="top">spooky surreal - this is an album cover (oops, what do they call those now?)  This is a CD cover!  Great eye to see this and nice work capturing it.  What does it look like in color is my main question - and I''d prefer a little more contrasty around the edges of the vortex - nice work though!</td>', 'spooky surreal - this is an album cover (oops, what do they call those now?)  This is a CD cover!  Great eye to see this and nice work capturing it.  What does it look like in color is my main question - and I''d prefer a little more contrasty around the edges of the vortex - nice work though!', '2006-06-27 02:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557064, 353403, 31403, '<td valign="top">pretty - would like to see either no angle (strictly horizontal lines) or more angle.  This 5 degrees (or whatever it actually is) seems too little for my eye, and feels like an oversight.  6</td>', 'pretty - would like to see either no angle (strictly horizontal lines) or more angle.  This 5 degrees (or whatever it actually is) seems too little for my eye, and feels like an oversight.  6', '2006-06-27 02:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557069, 353412, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh, nice creative!  I see this and think "I should have thought of that!".  I think the sky blur is cool, but keeping it in the shot dillutes your image by making your subject smaller - I''d like to experiment with a "panoramic" kind of crop from just below his hands to just above his head, and take some of the right side off too so he''s on the "third" line.  Maybe rotate the crop so you have the blur lines making an angle?  But you had MUCH more fun shooting this than I did!  Although I didn''t get motion sick!  :-)  5</td>', 'oh, nice creative!  I see this and think "I should have thought of that!".  I think the sky blur is cool, but keeping it in the shot dillutes your image by making your subject smaller - I''d like to experiment with a "panoramic" kind of crop from just below his hands to just above his head, and take some of the right side off too so he''s on the "third" line.  Maybe rotate the crop so you have the blur lines making an angle?  But you had MUCH more fun shooting this than I did!  Although I didn''t get motion sick!  :-)  5', '2006-06-27 02:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557080, 353329, 60862, '<td valign="top">The title and the pic go very, very well together.  I had a similar idea, but ended up using another shot.  Yours turned out much better, anyway!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=354229" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60862/thumb/354229.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60862/thumb/354229.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60862/thumb/354229.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The title and the pic go very, very well together.  I had a similar idea, but ended up using another shot.  Yours turned out much better, anyway! ', '2006-06-27 02:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557082, 353511, 60862, '<td valign="top">Clever!  Nice use of motion blur to convey a frantic feeling.  9.</td>', 'Clever!  Nice use of motion blur to convey a frantic feeling.  9.', '2006-06-27 02:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557086, 352512, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, beautiful use of a slow shutter speed, beautiful location.<br/> <br/>Sometimes I like borders, but this one distracts me.  But that''s a nitpick.  10.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, beautiful use of a slow shutter speed, beautiful location. Sometimes I like borders, but this one distracts me.  But that''s a nitpick.  10.', '2006-06-27 02:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557090, 351746, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and it matches your title well.  I''m giving it an 8.  If the boy''s face had been clearer, it would''ve been a 9 or 10.  I''m not saying it''s possible to take this shot with his face clearer, but I can dream, can''t I? :)</td>', 'Great idea, and it matches your title well.  I''m giving it an 8.  If the boy''s face had been clearer, it would''ve been a 9 or 10.  I''m not saying it''s possible to take this shot with his face clearer, but I can dream, can''t I? :)', '2006-06-27 02:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557091, 353701, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice composition, nice use of motion blur to convey the story!  9.</td>', 'Nice idea, nice composition, nice use of motion blur to convey the story!  9.', '2006-06-27 03:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557095, 353308, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice idea (and nice aim!).  The colors and the focus are both a bit soft, though.  With a sharper background, more contrast in the colors, and maybe a higher angle shot, this would''ve been one of my favorites.</td>', 'Nice idea (and nice aim!).  The colors and the focus are both a bit soft, though.  With a sharper background, more contrast in the colors, and maybe a higher angle shot, this would''ve been one of my favorites.', '2006-06-27 03:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557099, 353215, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Such a rigid pose - matches exactly what I''ve seen in documentaries.  They really do seem like they have springs in their feet.  8.<br/> <br/>My one suggestion would be to crop out the black part at the top, which I find distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Such a rigid pose - matches exactly what I''ve seen in documentaries.  They really do seem like they have springs in their feet.  8. My one suggestion would be to crop out the black part at the top, which I find distracting.', '2006-06-27 03:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557101, 353486, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  It seems a little overexposed, but maybe that was your choice?</td>', 'Great idea.  It seems a little overexposed, but maybe that was your choice?', '2006-06-27 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557103, 353708, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very pretty abstract.  What is it?</td>', 'Very pretty abstract.  What is it?', '2006-06-27 03:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557105, 353716, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This pic really conveys the emotion and jangled nerves of rush hour. 8.</td>', 'Wow.  This pic really conveys the emotion and jangled nerves of rush hour. 8.', '2006-06-27 03:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557108, 353306, 60862, '<td valign="top">This pic really conveys the speed and joy of a young child.  Just wish her face were a clearer.</td>', 'This pic really conveys the speed and joy of a young child.  Just wish her face were a clearer.', '2006-06-27 03:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557109, 353614, 60862, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but I find the boy''s arms distracting.</td>', 'Pretty, but I find the boy''s arms distracting.', '2006-06-27 03:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557110, 351272, 60862, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!</td>', 'Cool shot!', '2006-06-27 03:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557111, 353370, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice idea on what to capture.  I''m a bit lost on the post-processing, though, and find it distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea on what to capture.  I''m a bit lost on the post-processing, though, and find it distracting.', '2006-06-27 03:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557114, 353267, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Perfectly sharp foreground really sets off the flowing water.  Where was this?  I''ve been on cruises, and can''t imagine water looking like this.</td>', 'Very cool.  Perfectly sharp foreground really sets off the flowing water.  Where was this?  I''ve been on cruises, and can''t imagine water looking like this.', '2006-06-27 03:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557115, 353751, 60862, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  I just found it cropped a bit high.</td>', 'Neat idea.  I just found it cropped a bit high.', '2006-06-27 03:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557117, 353635, 60862, '<td valign="top">GREAT idea.  And I really like the elongated coin images.  But the bright glare in the middle is really distracting - is that your flash?  Also, I''d crop it tighter so you don''t get the round bits in the upper corners.</td>', 'GREAT idea.  And I really like the elongated coin images.  But the bright glare in the middle is really distracting - is that your flash?  Also, I''d crop it tighter so you don''t get the round bits in the upper corners.', '2006-06-27 03:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557118, 353734, 60862, '<td valign="top">Perfect use of blur to convey speed with a sharp subject. 9.</td>', 'Perfect use of blur to convey speed with a sharp subject. 9.', '2006-06-27 03:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557119, 352846, 60862, '<td valign="top">Another great motorcycle shot.  9.</td>', 'Another great motorcycle shot.  9.', '2006-06-27 03:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557120, 352740, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice job freezing both heads against the speeding backdrop.</td>', 'Nice job freezing both heads against the speeding backdrop.', '2006-06-27 03:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557123, 351904, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really like the sharpness in the biker.  Not perfect, but very good.  What pushed this to a 9 for me was the cropping - the long horizontal really emphasizes where he''s going with all of that speed.</td>', 'I really like the sharpness in the biker.  Not perfect, but very good.  What pushed this to a 9 for me was the cropping - the long horizontal really emphasizes where he''s going with all of that speed.', '2006-06-27 03:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557127, 353336, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  As a pilot, I can appreciate how hard it is to fly like this and as a hack photographer, I can appreciate how hard it is to pan along.<br/> <br/>Is it a model?</td>', 'Great shot!  As a pilot, I can appreciate how hard it is to fly like this and as a hack photographer, I can appreciate how hard it is to pan along. Is it a model?', '2006-06-27 03:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557129, 353753, 60862, '<td valign="top">Pretty. :)  Nice placement of the wheel''s center.</td>', 'Pretty. :)  Nice placement of the wheel''s center.', '2006-06-27 03:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557130, 353517, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the copper color.  How''d you get it to curve?</td>', 'Nice use of the copper color.  How''d you get it to curve?', '2006-06-27 03:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557131, 352528, 60862, '<td valign="top">It certainly is!  At least I enjoy it when on my bike.</td>', 'It certainly is!  At least I enjoy it when on my bike.', '2006-06-27 03:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557132, 353328, 60862, '<td valign="top">GREAT use of motion blur to reproduce a famous image.  How''d you do it?</td>', 'GREAT use of motion blur to reproduce a famous image.  How''d you do it?', '2006-06-27 03:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557133, 353362, 60862, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Way to go to be ready for the shot when it came.</td>', 'Funny!  Way to go to be ready for the shot when it came.', '2006-06-27 03:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557134, 353412, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great look on his face.  Reminds me of a Bill Cosby routine about when he was a kid.</td>', 'Great look on his face.  Reminds me of a Bill Cosby routine about when he was a kid.', '2006-06-27 03:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557135, 353488, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very interesting way to show speed.  What are all the shadows?</td>', 'Very interesting way to show speed.  What are all the shadows?', '2006-06-27 03:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557137, 352198, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like how you placed the heat source in the corner, and the sparks made nice trails.</td>', 'I like how you placed the heat source in the corner, and the sparks made nice trails.', '2006-06-27 03:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557139, 352311, 60862, '<td valign="top">What''d you put in the balloon to leave the outline when it popped?  Please tell us how you did it!</td>', 'What''d you put in the balloon to leave the outline when it popped?  Please tell us how you did it!', '2006-06-27 03:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557229, 353328, 16004, '<td valign="top">unfortunately, you''ve done this so well and effectively, you''ve gone and pretty wiped out much of the motion blur!  but it''s a fun playful homage to the original concept.  6.</td>', 'unfortunately, you''ve done this so well and effectively, you''ve gone and pretty wiped out much of the motion blur!  but it''s a fun playful homage to the original concept.  6.', '2006-06-27 04:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557230, 351272, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent.....</td>', 'Excellent.....', '2006-06-27 04:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557234, 353616, 16004, '<td valign="top">impressively sharp capture, and a great sense of movement too.  let down slightly by the white triangle in the background bottom left - pity it wasn''t green as well.  but aside from that very good - nice sense of scale also from the way it''s compoised / cropped.  8.</td>', 'impressively sharp capture, and a great sense of movement too.  let down slightly by the white triangle in the background bottom left - pity it wasn''t green as well.  but aside from that very good - nice sense of scale also from the way it''s compoised / cropped.  8.', '2006-06-27 04:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557235, 351382, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s a bit of a strange one, this.  i think there is too much going on in the frame vying for the viewers attention; the beach / coastal background, the person on the left being a bit too solid, the person on the right a bit too see-through, the bottles of water being an out of focus distraction.  the coluors feel a bit washed out too; i feel it needs to be bolder, more contrasty. also a bit more light on your subjects?  i don''t know, simplicity is probably preferable with something like this. 4.</td>', 'it''s a bit of a strange one, this.  i think there is too much going on in the frame vying for the viewers attention; the beach / coastal background, the person on the left being a bit too solid, the person on the right a bit too see-through, the bottles of water being an out of focus distraction.  the coluors feel a bit washed out too; i feel it needs to be bolder, more contrasty. also a bit more light on your subjects?  i don''t know, simplicity is probably preferable with something like this. 4.', '2006-06-27 04:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557238, 353379, 16004, '<td valign="top">well timed for what is a difficult shot to get.  the only thing i would probably play with is the crop; the bottom third is a bit redundant and a squarer crop closer to the bike guy might emphasise him a bit more.  i like the effect of the blur at the top though - looks like flourescent tubes exploding!  good achievement though, and nicely dramatic.  8.</td>', 'well timed for what is a difficult shot to get.  the only thing i would probably play with is the crop; the bottom third is a bit redundant and a squarer crop closer to the bike guy might emphasise him a bit more.  i like the effect of the blur at the top though - looks like flourescent tubes exploding!  good achievement though, and nicely dramatic.  8.', '2006-06-27 04:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557240, 353743, 16004, '<td valign="top">horses normally just freak me out, but this is gorgeous.  i only wish that the face could be just a smidgeon sharper; especially round the eyes and ears.  but the flowing mane, background, the b&amp;w tones, composition (i like how you''ve not bothered with its body or legs) all add up to make this a really great shot; bit sharper and it would be worthy of any poster store.  7.</td>', 'horses normally just freak me out, but this is gorgeous.  i only wish that the face could be just a smidgeon sharper; especially round the eyes and ears.  but the flowing mane, background, the b&w tones, composition (i like how you''ve not bothered with its body or legs) all add up to make this a really great shot; bit sharper and it would be worthy of any poster store.  7.', '2006-06-27 04:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557253, 353296, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is brilliant!  it''s a fantastic choice of subject, and expertly executed.  the colours fit with the style very well, the light and dark tones are marvellous, and the motion blur feels natural and just right.  it has a sparkle and pizzazz that''s very appealing, and it''s something i could happily hang on the wall.  so it''s a 10.</td>', 'this is brilliant!  it''s a fantastic choice of subject, and expertly executed.  the colours fit with the style very well, the light and dark tones are marvellous, and the motion blur feels natural and just right.  it has a sparkle and pizzazz that''s very appealing, and it''s something i could happily hang on the wall.  so it''s a 10.', '2006-06-27 05:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557286, 353734, 51638, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done sports shot.</td>', 'Very nicely done sports shot.', '2006-06-27 05:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557288, 353440, 51638, '<td valign="top">Great capture. You''ve done well to isolate the stationary head without any blur.</td>', 'Great capture. You''ve done well to isolate the stationary head without any blur.', '2006-06-27 05:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557289, 353305, 16004, '<td valign="top">well, you do get the prize for most dramatic title this week!  you have complied with the challenge, so no problems there.  It oculd do with some improvement in the white balance department; it has this light brown sheen over it which gives a false impression of colours - something which can easily be fixed post processing.  a lot of the bottom half of the picture is a bit unnecessary; having the principal subject in the top half rarely looks right i found, and by cropping say 5-10mm below the bottom edge of the cucumber might give a more balanced composition.  4.</td>', 'well, you do get the prize for most dramatic title this week!  you have complied with the challenge, so no problems there.  It oculd do with some improvement in the white balance department; it has this light brown sheen over it which gives a false impression of colours - something which can easily be fixed post processing.  a lot of the bottom half of the picture is a bit unnecessary; having the principal subject in the top half rarely looks right i found, and by cropping say 5-10mm below the bottom edge of the cucumber might give a more balanced composition.  4.', '2006-06-27 05:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557290, 350223, 51638, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I just don''t find this subject matter or composition particularly interesting.</td>', 'Sorry, but I just don''t find this subject matter or composition particularly interesting.', '2006-06-27 05:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557292, 353404, 51638, '<td valign="top">Classical ''soft water'' shot, done fairly well. The only slight distraction for me is the blow out sky above the waterfall. The image would have worked better IMO if you''d managed to capture a contrasting blue sky, or an orange sunrise/sunset sky instead.</td>', 'Classical ''soft water'' shot, done fairly well. The only slight distraction for me is the blow out sky above the waterfall. The image would have worked better IMO if you''d managed to capture a contrasting blue sky, or an orange sunrise/sunset sky instead.', '2006-06-27 05:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557295, 349735, 16004, '<td valign="top">lovely shot!  the zoom blur effect is very, er, effective here; and not done excessively so either.  the mix of bright colours is very pleasing, though one wonders how it would look with the contrast and brightness cranked up a little bit to make it feel a bit more neon like...  still, excellently dramatic cityscape.  9.</td>', 'lovely shot!  the zoom blur effect is very, er, effective here; and not done excessively so either.  the mix of bright colours is very pleasing, though one wonders how it would look with the contrast and brightness cranked up a little bit to make it feel a bit more neon like...  still, excellently dramatic cityscape.  9.', '2006-06-27 05:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557297, 353520, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice enough image, but I''m afraid I just don''t see how the boxes add anything. Sorry.</td>', 'Nice enough image, but I''m afraid I just don''t see how the boxes add anything. Sorry.', '2006-06-27 05:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557301, 352659, 51638, '<td valign="top">Being a paddler and a photographer I''m a sucker for these shots. The only thing that would''ve improved this IMO is a little more colour. Perhaps a little more of the orange kayak visible.</td>', 'Being a paddler and a photographer I''m a sucker for these shots. The only thing that would''ve improved this IMO is a little more colour. Perhaps a little more of the orange kayak visible.', '2006-06-27 06:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557302, 353514, 51638, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get this comment a dozen times over....This looks like a shot from a Volvo catalogue. Considering the car has no licence plate I''m wondering if you took this as part of a commercial shoot? Well done.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get this comment a dozen times over....This looks like a shot from a Volvo catalogue. Considering the car has no licence plate I''m wondering if you took this as part of a commercial shoot? Well done.', '2006-06-27 06:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557305, 353249, 51638, '<td valign="top">As the gates are up, I''m guessing there was some slalom going on. So, why not wait and capture a paddler in the shot. Would have made it that bit more interesting.</td>', 'As the gates are up, I''m guessing there was some slalom going on. So, why not wait and capture a paddler in the shot. Would have made it that bit more interesting.', '2006-06-27 06:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557306, 351746, 46885, '<td valign="top">Like the movement and positioning of subject in the shot. Some gentle work on levels would make it a bit more snappy</td>', 'Like the movement and positioning of subject in the shot. Some gentle work on levels would make it a bit more snappy', '2006-06-27 06:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557308, 353740, 46885, '<td valign="top">Dying to know what it is</td>', 'Dying to know what it is', '2006-06-27 06:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557309, 353714, 46885, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Where''s the motion?</td>', 'Nice shot. Where''s the motion?', '2006-06-27 06:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557314, 351904, 46885, '<td valign="top">Nice pan, but I''d give the cyclist a bit more prominence. The black thingie loos obstructing. Also - some unwanted curvature, easily corrected.</td>', 'Nice pan, but I''d give the cyclist a bit more prominence. The black thingie loos obstructing. Also - some unwanted curvature, easily corrected.', '2006-06-27 06:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557316, 351943, 46885, '<td valign="top">Good thing he''s in black, cause otherwise absence of hands would be a bit worrysome. Very interesting shot, I''d be coming back to find out how you made it</td>', 'Good thing he''s in black, cause otherwise absence of hands would be a bit worrysome. Very interesting shot, I''d be coming back to find out how you made it', '2006-06-27 06:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557319, 352338, 46885, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, but the dense grill is hiding much of the movement, imho. Removing it would probably rob the picture of all its ''worn'' quality, so there''s a bit of a dillema. Possibly - come closer?</td>', 'Nice tones, but the dense grill is hiding much of the movement, imho. Removing it would probably rob the picture of all its ''worn'' quality, so there''s a bit of a dillema. Possibly - come closer?', '2006-06-27 06:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
