(2557321, 352736, 46885, '<td valign="top">Bit messy, if you ask me. Motion is evident allright, but the story in the shot gets almost totally obstructed by this.</td>', 'Bit messy, if you ask me. Motion is evident allright, but the story in the shot gets almost totally obstructed by this.', '2006-06-27 06:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
