(2558320, 353513, 54731, '<td valign="top">Are you the same guy as the piñata? Anyways, Muerte is feminine, so it would be las muertes, but usually you don''t refer to death with a plural, so the name of this picture would actually have to be El Arbol de la Muerte. That said, I really like it and especially how the bottom doesn´t seem to be afected by the motion. Very nice! 8.</td>', 'Are you the same guy as the piñata? Anyways, Muerte is feminine, so it would be las muertes, but usually you don''t refer to death with a plural, so the name of this picture would actually have to be El Arbol de la Muerte. That said, I really like it and especially how the bottom doesn´t seem to be afected by the motion. Very nice! 8.', '2006-06-27 15:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558323, 352738, 54731, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting here.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting here.', '2006-06-27 15:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558325, 353464, 54731, '<td valign="top">The hot spot is too big really. Maybe color would have suited it better?</td>', 'The hot spot is too big really. Maybe color would have suited it better?', '2006-06-27 15:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558337, 352338, 54731, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and interesting subject, I think center would have worked this time but it''s not bad on the side either. It might have been more interesting with a person on the side with her hair blowing or something.</td>', 'Good lighting and interesting subject, I think center would have worked this time but it''s not bad on the side either. It might have been more interesting with a person on the side with her hair blowing or something.', '2006-06-27 15:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558339, 352486, 54731, '<td valign="top">It''s beautiful but somehow it looks a little artificial. Good job anyways.</td>', 'It''s beautiful but somehow it looks a little artificial. Good job anyways.', '2006-06-27 15:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
