(2558349, 353153, 54731, '<td valign="top">Oh, if they were both in focus it would be so perfect... Still has its magic, 7.</td>', 'Oh, if they were both in focus it would be so perfect... Still has its magic, 7.', '2006-06-27 15:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558366, 352512, 37961, '<td valign="top">Wow thats pretty. Swimmable?</td>', 'Wow thats pretty. Swimmable?', '2006-06-27 15:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558390, 353663, 60141, '<td valign="top">not sure this meets the challenge...neat image but needs some motion blur.</td>', 'not sure this meets the challenge...neat image but needs some motion blur.', '2006-06-27 15:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558401, 353728, 31133, '<td valign="top">Great capture, especially with the legs stretched out as they are. I''d like to see more contrast, though. For me, this is a little too flat, but I think with some post-processing to darken the blacks and lighten the whites, this would''ve done much better because it is such a great capture. I really like the simplicity of the scene, with just the bird, the water, and the bird''s shadow.</td>', 'Great capture, especially with the legs stretched out as they are. I''d like to see more contrast, though. For me, this is a little too flat, but I think with some post-processing to darken the blacks and lighten the whites, this would''ve done much better because it is such a great capture. I really like the simplicity of the scene, with just the bird, the water, and the bird''s shadow.', '2006-06-27 16:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558411, 353716, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is really wonderful! It feels like these cars are in the middle of an explosion. It''s effective (and hard to figure out!) that the clouds are so still with all that other motion going on. I''m curious about what all the explosive pink is... trees in bloom or smoke?</td>', 'This is really wonderful! It feels like these cars are in the middle of an explosion. It''s effective (and hard to figure out!) that the clouds are so still with all that other motion going on. I''m curious about what all the explosive pink is... trees in bloom or smoke?', '2006-06-27 16:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558418, 353735, 31133, '<td valign="top">Pretty black shoes - and practical, too :-) The motion blur here is more effective than in many I''ve seen in this challenge because it really adds to the story. Interesting how the guy in the dress is walking in the opposite direction to the rest of the crowd. The flag and the black sign are slightly distracting, but I guess you took the opportunity to get this shot when it arose and I don''t blame you for that!</td>', 'Pretty black shoes - and practical, too :-) The motion blur here is more effective than in many I''ve seen in this challenge because it really adds to the story. Interesting how the guy in the dress is walking in the opposite direction to the rest of the crowd. The flag and the black sign are slightly distracting, but I guess you took the opportunity to get this shot when it arose and I don''t blame you for that!', '2006-06-27 16:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558432, 353146, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice color combination with the three colors purple, green, and yellow-orange. For me, this would be much more effective if either the bee were in focus or if the entire image were motion blur. Having the flowers in focus and nothing else  feels more accidental to me that if it were the other way around. I really like how you''ve succeeded in framing the bee with the flowers.</td>', 'Nice color combination with the three colors purple, green, and yellow-orange. For me, this would be much more effective if either the bee were in focus or if the entire image were motion blur. Having the flowers in focus and nothing else  feels more accidental to me that if it were the other way around. I really like how you''ve succeeded in framing the bee with the flowers.', '2006-06-27 16:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558442, 353012, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is perfect to me. The arrows in the road, combined with the angle make the shot unique and eye catching. They literally tell my eyes where to go. Definitely a 10 and nothing less! I also really like the high contrast and lack of distraction. Everything that''s here should be here, which is something I learn from images like this.</td>', 'This is perfect to me. The arrows in the road, combined with the angle make the shot unique and eye catching. They literally tell my eyes where to go. Definitely a 10 and nothing less! I also really like the high contrast and lack of distraction. Everything that''s here should be here, which is something I learn from images like this.', '2006-06-27 16:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558443, 353510, 23294, '<td valign="top">It looks like the exposure here was pretty good, but I''d like to see more contrast, and maybe more saturation.  The sky while obviouly having a hint of blue is somewhat grey, is this because of the exposure or post processing maybe?  If you would have somehow managed to get somebody to scare them towards you I think the shot would have benifited from that.</td>', 'It looks like the exposure here was pretty good, but I''d like to see more contrast, and maybe more saturation.  The sky while obviouly having a hint of blue is somewhat grey, is this because of the exposure or post processing maybe?  If you would have somehow managed to get somebody to scare them towards you I think the shot would have benifited from that.', '2006-06-27 16:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558447, 353720, 31133, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting! This is so simple and creative. Would look nice framed on a wall.</td>', 'Looks like a painting! This is so simple and creative. Would look nice framed on a wall.', '2006-06-27 16:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558448, 353406, 23294, '<td valign="top">A nice shot here.  The movement is subtle but I would say not too little.  The face is nice and clear which is exactly what one should strive for.  I really like the setting here as well.</td>', 'A nice shot here.  The movement is subtle but I would say not too little.  The face is nice and clear which is exactly what one should strive for.  I really like the setting here as well.', '2006-06-27 16:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558451, 352850, 23294, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene here.  I do not however get the feeling of a jump going on in the shot.  The motion blur doesn''t appear very visible to me, and plays a minor role.  I really like the colors but I think that maybe something is lacking in the composition of this photo.</td>', 'Interesting scene here.  I do not however get the feeling of a jump going on in the shot.  The motion blur doesn''t appear very visible to me, and plays a minor role.  I really like the colors but I think that maybe something is lacking in the composition of this photo.', '2006-06-27 16:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558457, 353370, 23294, '<td valign="top">Definately see the motion blur here, however it''s a subject that''s often done.  The backround and processing for this photos are very unique.  Super amounts of contrast between the ground and the sky.  Perhaps a little too much processing in my eyes, this is starting to get into digital art rather that what I would recognize as a photograph.</td>', 'Definately see the motion blur here, however it''s a subject that''s often done.  The backround and processing for this photos are very unique.  Super amounts of contrast between the ground and the sky.  Perhaps a little too much processing in my eyes, this is starting to get into digital art rather that what I would recognize as a photograph.', '2006-06-27 16:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558461, 353730, 23294, '<td valign="top">I really like this abstract feeling, the blur really adds to the normally dull flower scene.</td>', 'I really like this abstract feeling, the blur really adds to the normally dull flower scene.', '2006-06-27 16:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558465, 352782, 23294, '<td valign="top">A little too blurred for this type of image.  Would have loved to see it from the other angle with the child facing the camera.  The ball looks very cool in this shot though!</td>', 'A little too blurred for this type of image.  Would have loved to see it from the other angle with the child facing the camera.  The ball looks very cool in this shot though!', '2006-06-27 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558466, 353663, 23294, '<td valign="top">The subject is not terribly interesting, and I can''t find any motion blur whatsoever.</td>', 'The subject is not terribly interesting, and I can''t find any motion blur whatsoever.', '2006-06-27 16:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558472, 353249, 32378, '<td valign="top">For me this doesn''t work well as a black and white.</td>', 'For me this doesn''t work well as a black and white.', '2006-06-27 16:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558473, 351691, 23294, '<td valign="top">The glares in the water probably could have been a little better with the help of a circular polarizing filter.  The whole image is somewhat bland, the water is a drepressing color and the mallard''s details are hard to make out.  If it wasn''t a motion blur challenge I would have guessed it was just a mistake in settings.  However, animals are hard subjects to capture well in motion and I''m sure with some practice things will turn out better and better.</td>', 'The glares in the water probably could have been a little better with the help of a circular polarizing filter.  The whole image is somewhat bland, the water is a drepressing color and the mallard''s details are hard to make out.  If it wasn''t a motion blur challenge I would have guessed it was just a mistake in settings.  However, animals are hard subjects to capture well in motion and I''m sure with some practice things will turn out better and better.', '2006-06-27 16:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558474, 352846, 23294, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, you can see the eyes and read all the detail on the bike, the wheels are blurred and the backround too.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, you can see the eyes and read all the detail on the bike, the wheels are blurred and the backround too.  Nicely done.', '2006-06-27 16:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558477, 353739, 23294, '<td valign="top">an interesting take on this challenge, I like the idea.  The white balance is very warm, I think more natural tones would have been a good choice for this.</td>', 'an interesting take on this challenge, I like the idea.  The white balance is very warm, I think more natural tones would have been a good choice for this.', '2006-06-27 16:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
