(2558481, 352983, 23294, '<td valign="top">Not really a fan of this blur you''ve chosen to do.  However the colors are spot on.  I hope that typo in the title doesn''t hurt you.</td>', 'Not really a fan of this blur you''ve chosen to do.  However the colors are spot on.  I hope that typo in the title doesn''t hurt you.', '2006-06-27 16:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
