(2558490, 353438, 23294, '<td valign="top">The image doesn''t convey motion blur to me.  I know you want us to look at the flying bee but from what I can tell it was just out of focus.  The composition itself is good and the focus on the closer bee is good, but I just don''t see it meeting the challenge.</td>', 'The image doesn''t convey motion blur to me.  I know you want us to look at the flying bee but from what I can tell it was just out of focus.  The composition itself is good and the focus on the closer bee is good, but I just don''t see it meeting the challenge.', '2006-06-27 16:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
