(2558501, 353569, 23294, '<td valign="top">Definately pushing the handholding limits with this one.  Amazing to see such long streaks and still a pretty in focus and sharp face (especially considering the back legs have completely vanished!).  Nice work.</td>', 'Definately pushing the handholding limits with this one.  Amazing to see such long streaks and still a pretty in focus and sharp face (especially considering the back legs have completely vanished!).  Nice work.', '2006-06-27 16:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
