(2558528, 353616, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the motion you showed. However I think the composition would be better with the car on the right side of the shot so it is driving into the picture instead of out of it.</td>', 'I like the motion you showed. However I think the composition would be better with the car on the right side of the shot so it is driving into the picture instead of out of it.', '2006-06-27 16:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
