(2558622, 353408, 31133, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some nice motion going on here with great sharpness everywhere else. Unfortunately, the image feels like it''s too much, too gaudy, and misses some of the drama. My idea when viewing this is that it might be really effective in black and white or duotone. That might also help the dilema of the bright white light at left. I would''ve done the exact same left crop as you did, even with the light, since the "Playball" text is a good built-in title.</td>', 'You''ve got some nice motion going on here with great sharpness everywhere else. Unfortunately, the image feels like it''s too much, too gaudy, and misses some of the drama. My idea when viewing this is that it might be really effective in black and white or duotone. That might also help the dilema of the bright white light at left. I would''ve done the exact same left crop as you did, even with the light, since the "Playball" text is a good built-in title.', '2006-06-27 17:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558626, 353716, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot I like the effect you achieved.</td>', 'Nice shot I like the effect you achieved.', '2006-06-27 17:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558630, 353283, 32378, '<td valign="top">This shot could be helped by a different background that would show off more of a blur, also the composition would be better is bike was on left riding into the shot instead of on the right riding out of the shot.</td>', 'This shot could be helped by a different background that would show off more of a blur, also the composition would be better is bike was on left riding into the shot instead of on the right riding out of the shot.', '2006-06-27 17:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558638, 353743, 58259, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, especially the contrast between the horse and the background, I also think you chose the perfect horse for this picture. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I love this picture, especially the contrast between the horse and the background, I also think you chose the perfect horse for this picture. Keep up the good work!', '2006-06-27 17:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558647, 353404, 58259, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the water and the rocks in this picture, as well as the feeling I get from looking at the water... it looks like you could just go jump in it and it would be soft. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I love the contrast between the water and the rocks in this picture, as well as the feeling I get from looking at the water... it looks like you could just go jump in it and it would be soft. Keep up the good work!', '2006-06-27 17:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558657, 353388, 58259, '<td valign="top">I love the illusion that the car is in motion, and the way that the part of the car that is closest to the camera has the lightest background. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I love the illusion that the car is in motion, and the way that the part of the car that is closest to the camera has the lightest background. Keep up the good work.', '2006-06-27 17:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558669, 353714, 54731, '<td valign="top">I thought about trying this but it''s really hard to get the face in focus, you almost got it!</td>', 'I thought about trying this but it''s really hard to get the face in focus, you almost got it!', '2006-06-27 17:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558684, 353739, 54731, '<td valign="top">The skin tone is a little weird, but I like it overall.</td>', 'The skin tone is a little weird, but I like it overall.', '2006-06-27 17:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558688, 351943, 54731, '<td valign="top">The grass is a little distracting and his skin tone as well. Otherwise a great idea.</td>', 'The grass is a little distracting and his skin tone as well. Otherwise a great idea.', '2006-06-27 17:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558691, 353716, 54731, '<td valign="top">Nice feel to the image but I wish the entire white car was in the frame.</td>', 'Nice feel to the image but I wish the entire white car was in the frame.', '2006-06-27 17:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558713, 351741, 41047, '<td valign="top">this is very cool. the sky looks great.10.</td>', 'this is very cool. the sky looks great.10.', '2006-06-27 18:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558718, 353440, 41047, '<td valign="top">this is a real nice shot. i wish the background was a darker color tho, that would make the bird pop out. 8.</td>', 'this is a real nice shot. i wish the background was a darker color tho, that would make the bird pop out. 8.', '2006-06-27 18:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
