(2558830, 351382, 23294, '<td valign="top">The whole image seemds kindof soft and the orange.  The movement in the left person doesn''t seem natural to me and the person on the right is transparent.  I can''t tell if the person on the right is also the person on the left but I think that the light needed to be cast on the right subject to give it more substance.</td>', 'The whole image seemds kindof soft and the orange.  The movement in the left person doesn''t seem natural to me and the person on the right is transparent.  I can''t tell if the person on the right is also the person on the left but I think that the light needed to be cast on the right subject to give it more substance.', '2006-06-27 18:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558842, 353306, 42179, '<td valign="top">Very lively and colorful.  Nice !</td>', 'Very lively and colorful.  Nice !', '2006-06-27 18:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558844, 349735, 42179, '<td valign="top">Colorful &amp; fine</td>', 'Colorful & fine', '2006-06-27 18:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558846, 353592, 23294, '<td valign="top">I think the motion blur here is a little too subtle.  It also looks like this is a heavy crop from a larger image, if that''s true try getting in closer with your camera, the quality will be better.</td>', 'I think the motion blur here is a little too subtle.  It also looks like this is a heavy crop from a larger image, if that''s true try getting in closer with your camera, the quality will be better.', '2006-06-27 19:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558848, 353613, 23294, '<td valign="top">a cute portrait :-)</td>', 'a cute portrait :-)', '2006-06-27 19:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
