(2561689, 353403, 40819, '<td valign="top">Yawn...I know I saw this before...going the other way. Title should be Dejavu.. did I spell that right?<br/> <br/>Honestly on it own it isn''t very good in post. The image is sharp on the rider which is good, but the vignette is a bit too much as a border. Just my opinion and we all know about those so don''t be upset with me.</td>', 'Yawn...I know I saw this before...going the other way. Title should be Dejavu.. did I spell that right? Honestly on it own it isn''t very good in post. The image is sharp on the rider which is good, but the vignette is a bit too much as a border. Just my opinion and we all know about those so don''t be upset with me.', '2006-06-28 11:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
