(2563105, 353591, 23953, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones in this shot. I like how you allow the cab room to travel through the shot. Good composition. My only problem with this shot is the fact that the yellow lines in the center of the frame are really bright; the viewers eyes always travel to the brightest part of the photo. I think if the cab were the brightest part of the photo it would have more impact. I gave you a 9. Good Luck!</td>', 'I really like the tones in this shot. I like how you allow the cab room to travel through the shot. Good composition. My only problem with this shot is the fact that the yellow lines in the center of the frame are really bright; the viewers eyes always travel to the brightest part of the photo. I think if the cab were the brightest part of the photo it would have more impact. I gave you a 9. Good Luck!', '2006-06-28 17:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2563111, 353440, 23953, '<td valign="top">Great Capture! a tough shot to get, but you seemed to nail it. Good job using a large aperture to soften the background. 8</td>', 'Great Capture! a tough shot to get, but you seemed to nail it. Good job using a large aperture to soften the background. 8', '2006-06-28 17:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
