(2563132, 353514, 23953, '<td valign="top">The back drop makes this shot. Looks like an ad in a pamphlet at the dealership. My only suggestion would be to clone out the three orange objects behind the volve. 8</td>', 'The back drop makes this shot. Looks like an ad in a pamphlet at the dealership. My only suggestion would be to clone out the three orange objects behind the volve. 8', '2006-06-28 17:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2563152, 353413, 23953, '<td valign="top">Nice cascading waterfall. The overall image has a brownish tinge to it which makes the water look dirty. The water was crystal clear. I would have liked to see this shot on a different white balance to remove the brown. OK, on to the composition. I think its perfect. I like the lying tree braches across the front of the frame; it adds depth and interest which helps lead the viewers eye to the foot of the waterfall, then obviously up it. Perfect use of a long shutter to get that silky look of water in motion. 8</td>', 'Nice cascading waterfall. The overall image has a brownish tinge to it which makes the water look dirty. The water was crystal clear. I would have liked to see this shot on a different white balance to remove the brown. OK, on to the composition. I think its perfect. I like the lying tree braches across the front of the frame; it adds depth and interest which helps lead the viewers eye to the foot of the waterfall, then obviously up it. Perfect use of a long shutter to get that silky look of water in motion. 8', '2006-06-28 17:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
