(2566723, 353613, 59343, '<td valign="top">nice job on this photo.  the eyes are in great focus.  it definitely shows motion well.  I feel like I''m swingin with her.  The background distracts from her though.  I think it would look better with less DOF--ie a different background or less detail in the background.</td>', 'nice job on this photo.  the eyes are in great focus.  it definitely shows motion well.  I feel like I''m swingin with her.  The background distracts from her though.  I think it would look better with less DOF--ie a different background or less detail in the background.', '2006-06-29 16:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
