(2566728, 353434, 59343, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground in this photo.  nice job on the detail there.  The photo loses some it''s draw in the top/background however.  Not sure if PP would help or not.</td>', 'I like the foreground in this photo.  nice job on the detail there.  The photo loses some it''s draw in the top/background however.  Not sure if PP would help or not.', '2006-06-29 16:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566733, 353384, 59343, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the lightning.  The car lights are interesting too.  The picture just seems too dark overall --or the lightning occupies too little of the space in this image.  The road signs are a bit distracting too.  Again, though--nice capture on the lightning.</td>', 'Nice capture of the lightning.  The car lights are interesting too.  The picture just seems too dark overall --or the lightning occupies too little of the space in this image.  The road signs are a bit distracting too.  Again, though--nice capture on the lightning.', '2006-06-29 16:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
