(2566741, 352738, 59343, '<td valign="top">nice job on the water in this photo.  the greens in the background are pretty as well.  There is some loss of detail in the underbrush, but I love the moss and trees.</td>', 'nice job on the water in this photo.  the greens in the background are pretty as well.  There is some loss of detail in the underbrush, but I love the moss and trees.', '2006-06-29 16:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
