(2566747, 352850, 59343, '<td valign="top">wow psychedelic.</td>', 'wow psychedelic.', '2006-06-29 16:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566750, 353663, 59343, '<td valign="top">interesting concept and I give you credit for attempting to be creative.  the motion is not that evident to me in this picture though.  I can see a faint trail of motion--but it is just not prevalent enough to really draw your attention to it.</td>', 'interesting concept and I give you credit for attempting to be creative.  the motion is not that evident to me in this picture though.  I can see a faint trail of motion--but it is just not prevalent enough to really draw your attention to it.', '2006-06-29 16:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566752, 352659, 59343, '<td valign="top">wow, i like this photo.  some might think it''s a little chaotic (i''m just guessing), but I like how it gives you the sense that you''re in the water with this guy gettin thrown around.  Nice job--maybe could be better if we weren''t lookin at his back and instead more of a profile or head on?</td>', 'wow, i like this photo.  some might think it''s a little chaotic (i''m just guessing), but I like how it gives you the sense that you''re in the water with this guy gettin thrown around.  Nice job--maybe could be better if we weren''t lookin at his back and instead more of a profile or head on?', '2006-06-29 16:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566756, 352311, 59343, '<td valign="top">I like shots like this.  I love to see explosions captured on film--so amazingly dynamic.  That being said I think this one should be a bit sharper (ie the shutterspeed maybe was a bit slow), it would be better in my mind to see the plastic rupturing rather than just see a shadow of it.</td>', 'I like shots like this.  I love to see explosions captured on film--so amazingly dynamic.  That being said I think this one should be a bit sharper (ie the shutterspeed maybe was a bit slow), it would be better in my mind to see the plastic rupturing rather than just see a shadow of it.', '2006-06-29 16:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566759, 353365, 59343, '<td valign="top">Nice take on motion blur.  I like the effect that the zooming in has created.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice take on motion blur.  I like the effect that the zooming in has created.  Nice shot.', '2006-06-29 16:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566768, 353656, 59343, '<td valign="top">nice job on the motion blur on the water.  nice texture on the wood.</td>', 'nice job on the motion blur on the water.  nice texture on the wood.', '2006-06-29 16:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566771, 353101, 59343, '<td valign="top">very cool image of this candle.  i love the flame and the trail it''s leaving.  i dont like the background.  probably would have been more powerful against a dark brown or black background.</td>', 'very cool image of this candle.  i love the flame and the trail it''s leaving.  i dont like the background.  probably would have been more powerful against a dark brown or black background.', '2006-06-29 16:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566775, 352467, 59343, '<td valign="top">I dont think there is enough background to show significant motion blur on this guy.  i initially didn''t think i saw any at all.  i do like the concept though and the black and white really makes this shot.  i think the grain gives it a nice effect as well.</td>', 'I dont think there is enough background to show significant motion blur on this guy.  i initially didn''t think i saw any at all.  i do like the concept though and the black and white really makes this shot.  i think the grain gives it a nice effect as well.', '2006-06-29 16:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
