(2566778, 353649, 59343, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a couple of these in this challenge and I like the effect.  I think this one is very well done.  Almost rays of light coming out of the flower--excellent.</td>', 'I''ve seen a couple of these in this challenge and I like the effect.  I think this one is very well done.  Almost rays of light coming out of the flower--excellent.', '2006-06-29 16:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566780, 353219, 27605, '<td valign="top">Bravo! I will guess that you may get a "too centered" comment or two but I love it!  Brave venture beyond the rules (such as "rule of 3rds" or "fill the frame", etc... not referring to challenge rules here) and a solid {9} from me :o)</td>', 'Bravo! I will guess that you may get a "too centered" comment or two but I love it!  Brave venture beyond the rules (such as "rule of 3rds" or "fill the frame", etc... not referring to challenge rules here) and a solid {9} from me :o)', '2006-06-29 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566782, 353035, 59343, '<td valign="top">this image definitely gives the impression of motion.  I like the child running like this.  I love the background--it''s simple and really brings out the child better.  Might have been better with the eyes in focus? not sure...well done anyway.</td>', 'this image definitely gives the impression of motion.  I like the child running like this.  I love the background--it''s simple and really brings out the child better.  Might have been better with the eyes in focus? not sure...well done anyway.', '2006-06-29 16:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566789, 350203, 59343, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. The sense of motion is excellent.  Great job</td>', 'I like this shot. The sense of motion is excellent.  Great job', '2006-06-29 16:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566794, 353404, 59343, '<td valign="top">This shot is beautiful.  I love the soft water and the line it takes across the photo.  I wish the rest of the rocks were a bit brighter.  Looks like it might have been a rough time of day for photos (ie the overcast looking sky and dark rocks), but great composition.</td>', 'This shot is beautiful.  I love the soft water and the line it takes across the photo.  I wish the rest of the rocks were a bit brighter.  Looks like it might have been a rough time of day for photos (ie the overcast looking sky and dark rocks), but great composition.', '2006-06-29 16:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566797, 352740, 59343, '<td valign="top">nice job on this shot.  I like how the rider and horse appear in this composition.  the blur actually sets them apart nicely from the background.  The colors only seem a bit flat to me otherwise.</td>', 'nice job on this shot.  I like how the rider and horse appear in this composition.  the blur actually sets them apart nicely from the background.  The colors only seem a bit flat to me otherwise.', '2006-06-29 16:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566798, 351891, 59343, '<td valign="top">Ok well I like the idea of capturing the wind the way you have.  I think I can almost feel the wind.  I don''t like the choice of the red barn(?) as the background.  I think it distracts from the composition.  Great idea otherwise though.</td>', 'Ok well I like the idea of capturing the wind the way you have.  I think I can almost feel the wind.  I don''t like the choice of the red barn(?) as the background.  I think it distracts from the composition.  Great idea otherwise though.', '2006-06-29 16:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566807, 351746, 59343, '<td valign="top">very cool image.  the water on the swimmer looks great.  nice artistic take on a typically photojournalistic shot.</td>', 'very cool image.  the water on the swimmer looks great.  nice artistic take on a typically photojournalistic shot.', '2006-06-29 16:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566813, 353459, 59343, '<td valign="top">great shot.  i love the feathers falling.  the background is perfect for this.  it creates a nice line throughout the photo.</td>', 'great shot.  i love the feathers falling.  the background is perfect for this.  it creates a nice line throughout the photo.', '2006-06-29 16:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566816, 349946, 59343, '<td valign="top">I think the shutterspeed was too long to actually capture the motion.  The water just looks misty--doesn''t really capture motion to me otherwise.</td>', 'I think the shutterspeed was too long to actually capture the motion.  The water just looks misty--doesn''t really capture motion to me otherwise.', '2006-06-29 16:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566818, 351272, 59343, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  I think kthe picture looks oversharpened (I think that''s what I think the issue is).  I love the wave though.  It looks great.</td>', 'I like this photo.  I think kthe picture looks oversharpened (I think that''s what I think the issue is).  I love the wave though.  It looks great.', '2006-06-29 16:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566821, 353734, 59343, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot of this motorcycle.  Great stop action and clarity on the rider and his bike.  The background definitely shows motion blur.  Great overall shot.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot of this motorcycle.  Great stop action and clarity on the rider and his bike.  The background definitely shows motion blur.  Great overall shot.', '2006-06-29 16:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566826, 353393, 59343, '<td valign="top">This so far is the best pool shot I''ve seen.  The background isn''t noisy or grainy--it''s smooth and velvety looking.  The movement on the balls look great.</td>', 'This so far is the best pool shot I''ve seen.  The background isn''t noisy or grainy--it''s smooth and velvety looking.  The movement on the balls look great.', '2006-06-29 16:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566831, 353591, 59343, '<td valign="top">Nice simple clean shot.  The taxi is in nice motion against a beautiful crisp background.  The color in this shot is fantastic.  Great job.</td>', 'Nice simple clean shot.  The taxi is in nice motion against a beautiful crisp background.  The color in this shot is fantastic.  Great job.', '2006-06-29 16:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566838, 352782, 59343, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nice attempt at a great shot.  I like the colors, I like the blur effect.  I, however, think the ball needs to be in a little sharper focus (although maybe not perfect focus) so that the viewer understands what he is looking at.  It took me a while to understand what I was looking at, and only after reading the title did I understand that there was supposed to be a football somewhere in the image--it just blends into the background.  I think the rest of the picture is great.</td>', 'I think this is a nice attempt at a great shot.  I like the colors, I like the blur effect.  I, however, think the ball needs to be in a little sharper focus (although maybe not perfect focus) so that the viewer understands what he is looking at.  It took me a while to understand what I was looking at, and only after reading the title did I understand that there was supposed to be a football somewhere in the image--it just blends into the background.  I think the rest of the picture is great.', '2006-06-29 16:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566843, 353746, 59343, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  Nice selective coloring to bring out the color of the ball.  Nice sky/background and overall image...everytime I see this image I have to click closer to get a little better view (probably helps that I like soccer).</td>', 'I love this shot.  Nice selective coloring to bring out the color of the ball.  Nice sky/background and overall image...everytime I see this image I have to click closer to get a little better view (probably helps that I like soccer).', '2006-06-29 16:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566976, 353263, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice, cool subject. Background is a bit busy perhaps with the orange lights.</td>', 'Nice, cool subject. Background is a bit busy perhaps with the orange lights.', '2006-06-29 18:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566980, 349946, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice calm scene, the big white border adds to that feeling. The warm light on the rocks works well with the blue of the water.</td>', 'Nice calm scene, the big white border adds to that feeling. The warm light on the rocks works well with the blue of the water.', '2006-06-29 18:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566983, 353406, 3032, '<td valign="top">The girl is nicely framed by the door. Interesting scene, good mix of motion and non-movement. I like it.</td>', 'The girl is nicely framed by the door. Interesting scene, good mix of motion and non-movement. I like it.', '2006-06-29 18:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
