(2572945, 353154, 1031, '<td valign="top">Your title reminds me of a joke (I may have made up) about how the reason Chinese food is so healthful is that all the recipes start with "First, take a wok ..."</td>', 'Your title reminds me of a joke (I may have made up) about how the reason Chinese food is so healthful is that all the recipes start with "First, take a wok ..."', '2006-07-01 19:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
