(2573358, 352311, 59031, '<td valign="top">Amazing</td>', 'Amazing', '2006-07-01 22:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573382, 353440, 32754, '<td valign="top">awesome image...crop may be a little tight; colors are beautiful.</td>', 'awesome image...crop may be a little tight; colors are beautiful.', '2006-07-01 22:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573392, 353054, 32754, '<td valign="top">this is an incredible photograph, a work of art..the saxophone almost looks as if it''s melting into a liquid...this is the best I''ve seen: composition and color are unique and lovely...I would give it an 11 if I could.</td>', 'this is an incredible photograph, a work of art..the saxophone almost looks as if it''s melting into a liquid...this is the best I''ve seen: composition and color are unique and lovely...I would give it an 11 if I could.', '2006-07-01 22:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573477, 353741, 61413, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great idea for a "blur" composition. With a little bit of work, the "great idea" could become a great photo. A few things I''d look to improve:<br/>1. Framing: the 2 main elements of the photo - the book and the face - are both a little out of frame. I would have made sure that all of the book, at least, was in-frame.<br/>2. Lighting: the lighting on the face is a little flat. I''d have tried to get a little more contrast happening on the face.<br/>3. Focus: the crispest, best lit part of the composition is the shoulder; well away from what are (I assume) supposed to be the main elements - the face and the book. This draws my eye away from the main elements.<br/> <br/>Don''t get me wrong, it''s a gresat idea, and there are some very good elements in the execution. The blur of the pages and the lighting on the book is well executed, and the expression on the face is just right. If you''d got a better result in the other areas that I mentioned, it would have been great.</td>', 'I think this is a great idea for a "blur" composition. With a little bit of work, the "great idea" could become a great photo. A few things I''d look to improve:1. Framing: the 2 main elements of the photo - the book and the face - are both a little out of frame. I would have made sure that all of the book, at least, was in-frame.2. Lighting: the lighting on the face is a little flat. I''d have tried to get a little more contrast happening on the face.3. Focus: the crispest, best lit part of the composition is the shoulder; well away from what are (I assume) supposed to be the main elements - the face and the book. This draws my eye away from the main elements. Don''t get me wrong, it''s a gresat idea, and there are some very good elements in the execution. The blur of the pages and the lighting on the book is well executed, and the expression on the face is just right. If you''d got a better result in the other areas that I mentioned, it would have been great.', '2006-07-01 23:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573488, 353101, 61413, '<td valign="top">A simple but innovative idea, well executed.<br/> <br/>As I''m looking at it on my screen, the image is covered in tiny rectangular blotches. I''m not sure if that''s part of the image, or some artifact of my browser. But it is a little distracting.<br/> <br/>If it was me, I''d have aimed for some more light and contrast on the candle.<br/> <br/>I''d be interested to here how you composed the shot.</td>', 'A simple but innovative idea, well executed. As I''m looking at it on my screen, the image is covered in tiny rectangular blotches. I''m not sure if that''s part of the image, or some artifact of my browser. But it is a little distracting. If it was me, I''d have aimed for some more light and contrast on the candle. I''d be interested to here how you composed the shot.', '2006-07-01 23:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573492, 353324, 61413, '<td valign="top">Well composed. But a bit contrived for my tastes. And the "blur" is just an incidental part of the composition.</td>', 'Well composed. But a bit contrived for my tastes. And the "blur" is just an incidental part of the composition.', '2006-07-01 23:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573505, 351272, 61413, '<td valign="top">I''m someone who''s been known to go and sit by the rocks and watch the waves crash like this for hours. I think this shot captures the impact well.<br/> <br/>I would have maybe tried to capture just a little more of the wave impact. Not moving it to the middle of the composition, obviously; but perhaps a little closer to the centre. And I''d have cropped more tightly - there''s a lot of rock with not very much happening. You need a reasonable amount of rock to give the wave-crash some context, but there''s a bit too much here.<br/> <br/>But I do like the wave-crash. Just the right amount of blur.</td>', 'I''m someone who''s been known to go and sit by the rocks and watch the waves crash like this for hours. I think this shot captures the impact well. I would have maybe tried to capture just a little more of the wave impact. Not moving it to the middle of the composition, obviously; but perhaps a little closer to the centre. And I''d have cropped more tightly - there''s a lot of rock with not very much happening. You need a reasonable amount of rock to give the wave-crash some context, but there''s a bit too much here. But I do like the wave-crash. Just the right amount of blur.', '2006-07-01 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573520, 353308, 61413, '<td valign="top">A great idea, moderately well executed.<br/> <br/>The blur "trail" of the eight-ball is maybe a little understated - but that''s really just a question of taste. And it''s a shame that the flourescent light reflection at the head of the table is so intrusive.<br/> <br/>I like the blur effect on the cue. And I think that, considering that it was probably shot under conditions that we far from "studio", it''s not a bad result.</td>', 'A great idea, moderately well executed. The blur "trail" of the eight-ball is maybe a little understated - but that''s really just a question of taste. And it''s a shame that the flourescent light reflection at the head of the table is so intrusive. I like the blur effect on the cue. And I think that, considering that it was probably shot under conditions that we far from "studio", it''s not a bad result.', '2006-07-01 23:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573527, 353362, 61413, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot. The sense of "turbulence" around the wings is great.<br/> <br/>My first reaction was that I would have cropped it more tightly. But on reflection I think youve got it right. The sparrow looking on has creates just the right sense of <i>"oh, I wanted some of that!"</i>.</td>', 'A lovely shot. The sense of "turbulence" around the wings is great. My first reaction was that I would have cropped it more tightly. But on reflection I think youve got it right. The sparrow looking on has creates just the right sense of "oh, I wanted some of that!".', '2006-07-01 23:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573534, 353328, 61413, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m missing something, but I don''t see a lot of motion blur here...</td>', 'Maybe I''m missing something, but I don''t see a lot of motion blur here...', '2006-07-01 23:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573542, 353654, 61413, '<td valign="top">It''s been done once or twice before. But a pleasant enough urban landscape.</td>', 'It''s been done once or twice before. But a pleasant enough urban landscape.', '2006-07-01 23:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573546, 353218, 61413, '<td valign="top">The wind blur creates some interesting elements in this shot. but it doesn''t quite "come together" for me, somehow.</td>', 'The wind blur creates some interesting elements in this shot. but it doesn''t quite "come together" for me, somehow.', '2006-07-01 23:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573565, 353739, 61413, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the blur here - it speaks to the essence of what is heppening when a guitarist is working their fret board hard.<br/> <br/>And keeping the guitar sharp, with all the blur in the hand, makes the shot technically well executed.<br/> <br/>now, if the blur had been limited to the fingers, with maybe some conspicuous speed blur on some of the strings, that would have been a masterpiece.</td>', 'I like the use of the blur here - it speaks to the essence of what is heppening when a guitarist is working their fret board hard. And keeping the guitar sharp, with all the blur in the hand, makes the shot technically well executed. now, if the blur had been limited to the fingers, with maybe some conspicuous speed blur on some of the strings, that would have been a masterpiece.', '2006-07-01 23:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573568, 353375, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, but the foot is a little <i>too</i> blurred to create the effect that you''re looking for, I think.</td>', 'A nice idea, but the foot is a little too blurred to create the effect that you''re looking for, I think.', '2006-07-01 23:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573580, 353734, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot - if ever I manage to capture one like this, I''ll be well chuffed.<br/> <br/>But the blur doesn''t feature strongly enough for it to stand out as a "motion blur" photo. If it had been at a slightly different angle, and there had been, say, some obvious blur in the wheel spokes to impart a real sense of speed, then it would have been a different story.<br/> <br/>A lovely photo, but not a "speed blur" photo.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot - if ever I manage to capture one like this, I''ll be well chuffed. But the blur doesn''t feature strongly enough for it to stand out as a "motion blur" photo. If it had been at a slightly different angle, and there had been, say, some obvious blur in the wheel spokes to impart a real sense of speed, then it would have been a different story. A lovely photo, but not a "speed blur" photo.', '2006-07-01 23:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573584, 353649, 61413, '<td valign="top">A veryt compelling effect. But <i>motion</i> blur? There is blur, certainly. But, given the subject matter, it doesn''t communicate a sense of motion.</td>', 'A veryt compelling effect. But motion blur? There is blur, certainly. But, given the subject matter, it doesn''t communicate a sense of motion.', '2006-07-01 23:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573590, 352740, 61413, '<td valign="top">Technically, a good shot. The bulk of the subject is crisp, while the background and the horse''s legs have just the right amount of blur to give a good sense of motion.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame the lighting is a little flat. And if there''d been a little more "happening" (such as, say, an approaching jump), it could have been excellent.</td>', 'Technically, a good shot. The bulk of the subject is crisp, while the background and the horse''s legs have just the right amount of blur to give a good sense of motion. It''s a shame the lighting is a little flat. And if there''d been a little more "happening" (such as, say, an approaching jump), it could have been excellent.', '2006-07-01 23:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573616, 353198, 61413, '<td valign="top">A very absorbing photo - I can look at it for ages without knowing or caring what it actually is.<br/> <br/>But I don''t get a sense of "motion blur" leaping out at me.</td>', 'A very absorbing photo - I can look at it for ages without knowing or caring what it actually is. But I don''t get a sense of "motion blur" leaping out at me.', '2006-07-01 23:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573640, 353737, 61413, '<td valign="top">I like this. I''m always a sucker for any photo with a strong reflection element, and this photo has that - there is a powerful sense of how highly polished is the metal of the engine cowling.<br/> <br/>I think the juxtaposition of the engine against the fuselage works well. and the colour saturation has been pumped up just enough.<br/> <br/>If anything, maybe the blur of the props is just a little understated. could''ve done with just a <i>slightly</i> longer exposure to make the prop rotation more of a focal point of the composition. But that''s being really picky.</td>', 'I like this. I''m always a sucker for any photo with a strong reflection element, and this photo has that - there is a powerful sense of how highly polished is the metal of the engine cowling. I think the juxtaposition of the engine against the fuselage works well. and the colour saturation has been pumped up just enough. If anything, maybe the blur of the props is just a little understated. could''ve done with just a slightly longer exposure to make the prop rotation more of a focal point of the composition. But that''s being really picky.', '2006-07-02 00:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573647, 353323, 61413, '<td valign="top">A great idea, and the shot is technically well executed. Lighting, focus, motion blur all come together well. I might have been inclined to broaden the framing a little, but that''s just my taste.<br/> <br/>But there''s a lack of emotion in the subjects that makes the whole thing seem a bit contrived, unfortunately. It doesn''t look like they mean it.</td>', 'A great idea, and the shot is technically well executed. Lighting, focus, motion blur all come together well. I might have been inclined to broaden the framing a little, but that''s just my taste. But there''s a lack of emotion in the subjects that makes the whole thing seem a bit contrived, unfortunately. It doesn''t look like they mean it.', '2006-07-02 00:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573657, 353412, 61413, '<td valign="top">It''s been done before, of course. but it still looks pretty good. There''s a real sense of rotation, here.<br/> <br/>The contrasting light and dark patches in the background work well. It''s a shame there isn''t more interesting lighting of the subject, though.</td>', 'It''s been done before, of course. but it still looks pretty good. There''s a real sense of rotation, here. The contrasting light and dark patches in the background work well. It''s a shame there isn''t more interesting lighting of the subject, though.', '2006-07-02 00:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573678, 352467, 61413, '<td valign="top">I like this. The rotational blur of the wheel and the brake disc, combined with the directional blur in the background, convey exactly the right sense of movement. This is helped by the reasonably large chunk of empty road to the left of the photo for the bike to "move into".<br/> <br/>I think monochrome is the right choice here. The slightly excessively chrome trim on the bike is definitely 50s heritage, and monochrome helps to reinforce that.<br/> <br/>I can''t help feeling that I would''ve liked to have seen just a little more of the bike in the shot, but I can''t work out how I would''ve done that without spoiling the overall composition. So it''s probably about right as it is.<br/> <br/>Must''ve been a tricky shot to take, too...</td>', 'I like this. The rotational blur of the wheel and the brake disc, combined with the directional blur in the background, convey exactly the right sense of movement. This is helped by the reasonably large chunk of empty road to the left of the photo for the bike to "move into". I think monochrome is the right choice here. The slightly excessively chrome trim on the bike is definitely 50s heritage, and monochrome helps to reinforce that. I can''t help feeling that I would''ve liked to have seen just a little more of the bike in the shot, but I can''t work out how I would''ve done that without spoiling the overall composition. So it''s probably about right as it is. Must''ve been a tricky shot to take, too...', '2006-07-02 00:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573680, 353101, 29011, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. The grate looking background is a nice addition, adds to the sense of motion. Though I reckon this would''ve worked nicely with just a plain background as well.</td>', 'I like the concept. The grate looking background is a nice addition, adds to the sense of motion. Though I reckon this would''ve worked nicely with just a plain background as well.', '2006-07-02 00:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573687, 352338, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice sense of rotational blur. And very evocative of a sense of a worn out piece of equipment from a bygone era, helped by the choice of monochrome.<br/> <br/>But the compoition needs a little more. I''ve no idea what, but it needs a little more.</td>', 'A nice sense of rotational blur. And very evocative of a sense of a worn out piece of equipment from a bygone era, helped by the choice of monochrome. But the compoition needs a little more. I''ve no idea what, but it needs a little more.', '2006-07-02 00:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573694, 353754, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed. But a speeding flower composition??!!</td>', 'Nicely executed. But a speeding flower composition??!!', '2006-07-02 00:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573695, 353161, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great mood here. Gotta love those saturated blues and greens. You got the water blur down nicely and the colorful car trails add to the shot. My favorite landscape shot which offers something more than just a long water exposure :)</td>', 'Great mood here. Gotta love those saturated blues and greens. You got the water blur down nicely and the colorful car trails add to the shot. My favorite landscape shot which offers something more than just a long water exposure :)', '2006-07-02 00:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573698, 353267, 61413, '<td valign="top">I think this could''ve been a great shot, if there was just a little context to what the two people were looking out at. Maybe a horizon or something - I don''t know.</td>', 'I think this could''ve been a great shot, if there was just a little context to what the two people were looking out at. Maybe a horizon or something - I don''t know.', '2006-07-02 00:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573716, 352486, 61413, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot. But the blur doesn''t evoke a sense of motion so much as of mistiness.</td>', 'A lovely shot. But the blur doesn''t evoke a sense of motion so much as of mistiness.', '2006-07-02 00:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573729, 353511, 61413, '<td valign="top">A great idea, and a "so close, but not quite" execution.<br/> <br/>Blurred hands and fingers, conveying a sense of rapid movement across the keyboard, would''ve been good. Adding one key being blurred by being depressed as the shutter was released, would have made it perfect. But these hands are not blurred so much as they''re only half there.</td>', 'A great idea, and a "so close, but not quite" execution. Blurred hands and fingers, conveying a sense of rapid movement across the keyboard, would''ve been good. Adding one key being blurred by being depressed as the shutter was released, would have made it perfect. But these hands are not blurred so much as they''re only half there.', '2006-07-02 00:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573733, 353215, 61413, '<td valign="top">The blur of the background and the legs works well to convey the movement of the animal. but there''s too much of this photo with nothing much going on. Maybe it needs to be cropped more tightly.</td>', 'The blur of the background and the legs works well to convey the movement of the animal. but there''s too much of this photo with nothing much going on. Maybe it needs to be cropped more tightly.', '2006-07-02 00:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573741, 353701, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot. The sense of the face-down cards being dealt across the table is very strong. Just the right amount of blur.<br/> <br/>But the first thought that sprang to my mind was "why would cards be getting dealt out when someone is already showing a full-house?"</td>', 'This is a lovely shot. The sense of the face-down cards being dealt across the table is very strong. Just the right amount of blur. But the first thought that sprang to my mind was "why would cards be getting dealt out when someone is already showing a full-house?"', '2006-07-02 00:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573752, 353513, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed, but I''m afraid I just don''t "get it". A spinning tree? "The trees of the dead"?</td>', 'Nicely executed, but I''m afraid I just don''t "get it". A spinning tree? "The trees of the dead"?', '2006-07-02 00:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573757, 353198, 29011, '<td valign="top">I take this as an abstract. Nice color but I just dont see it.</td>', 'I take this as an abstract. Nice color but I just dont see it.', '2006-07-02 00:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573761, 353751, 29011, '<td valign="top">You got the zooming technique down but I dont think the negative space works very well for this photo.</td>', 'You got the zooming technique down but I dont think the negative space works very well for this photo.', '2006-07-02 00:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573764, 353048, 61413, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I wondered whether the blur was perhaps a little understated, but on balance I think not.</td>', 'Very nice. I wondered whether the blur was perhaps a little understated, but on balance I think not.', '2006-07-02 00:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573771, 353446, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice shot overall but perhaps the motion blur is a little too subtle for the challenge. The sea looks wild because I see motion blur in many places and you still got the static human subject on the bach. Would''ve liked to see a bit more blur near the shorline. Not as easy task depending on the time of day this was taken, working without any ND filters.</td>', 'It''s a very nice shot overall but perhaps the motion blur is a little too subtle for the challenge. The sea looks wild because I see motion blur in many places and you still got the static human subject on the bach. Would''ve liked to see a bit more blur near the shorline. Not as easy task depending on the time of day this was taken, working without any ND filters.', '2006-07-02 00:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573772, 353329, 61413, '<td valign="top">I think the title definitely makes you look at this shot in a different way, which is great - helps us to see what the photographer saw.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame the ball is out of shot.</td>', 'I think the title definitely makes you look at this shot in a different way, which is great - helps us to see what the photographer saw. It''s a shame the ball is out of shot.', '2006-07-02 00:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573776, 353297, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great idea! you can really get the idea of the tension going on. Only nitpick would be that there is a sligh Cyan cast. A single Color Balance tweak would clear that right up.</td>', 'Great idea! you can really get the idea of the tension going on. Only nitpick would be that there is a sligh Cyan cast. A single Color Balance tweak would clear that right up.', '2006-07-02 00:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573778, 352528, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice use of directional blur in the background, and just a smidgeon of rotational blur in the spokes. Plenty of space to the right for the rider to "ride into" as well, creating a sense of forward direction.<br/> <br/>I''d have been inclined to clone out some of the stuff happening with the sky (if that''s within the rules, I haven''t checked).</td>', 'Nice use of directional blur in the background, and just a smidgeon of rotational blur in the spokes. Plenty of space to the right for the rider to "ride into" as well, creating a sense of forward direction. I''d have been inclined to clone out some of the stuff happening with the sky (if that''s within the rules, I haven''t checked).', '2006-07-02 00:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573779, 353048, 33400, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I hope I''m wrong, bt I bet this is not one with high DPC appeal.  Still, it captures the look and "feel" of a prop in motion.  Maybe I''m  one of a very few who have stared at something like this, just to try to see this very image in real life.<br/> <br/>Oh well.  Good colors and lighting.  I was going to suggest a wider crop, but I don''t think so.  It''s very good as is.  Nice work.</td>', 'I really like this.  I hope I''m wrong, bt I bet this is not one with high DPC appeal.  Still, it captures the look and "feel" of a prop in motion.  Maybe I''m  one of a very few who have stared at something like this, just to try to see this very image in real life. Oh well.  Good colors and lighting.  I was going to suggest a wider crop, but I don''t think so.  It''s very good as is.  Nice work.', '2006-07-02 00:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573780, 353403, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really nicely captured. This being Advanced Editing, I would crop off the object near the left side and just slightly selectively darken the bottom bright yellow streak a bit. Great job overall :)</td>', 'Really nicely captured. This being Advanced Editing, I would crop off the object near the left side and just slightly selectively darken the bottom bright yellow streak a bit. Great job overall :)', '2006-07-02 00:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573784, 353054, 29011, '<td valign="top">A splendid looking abstract. Gotta love those golden streaks.</td>', 'A splendid looking abstract. Gotta love those golden streaks.', '2006-07-02 00:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573786, 353440, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very good work. I''m curious about the background color though.  Still, the colors on the birds head are excellent, and the motion of the wings tells a tale of speed.  Great work.</td>', 'Very good work. I''m curious about the background color though.  Still, the colors on the birds head are excellent, and the motion of the wings tells a tale of speed.  Great work.', '2006-07-02 00:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573788, 353748, 61413, '<td valign="top">Beatiful!<br/> <br/>A crisply focused subject with bright primary colours against a speed-blurred and more subdued background - nice. The speed blurring of the wake works particularly well.<br/> <br/>I can''t make up my mind whether the stuff happening at the top of the photo adds or detracts, though...</td>', 'Beatiful! A crisply focused subject with bright primary colours against a speed-blurred and more subdued background - nice. The speed blurring of the wake works particularly well. I can''t make up my mind whether the stuff happening at the top of the photo adds or detracts, though...', '2006-07-02 00:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573794, 353384, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I like the unique twist on the ole Lightning shot. Not sure if the car light streaks add much to the image though then again they do help the signs post stand out and not blend into the dark background too early.</td>', 'This is a great shot. I like the unique twist on the ole Lightning shot. Not sure if the car light streaks add much to the image though then again they do help the signs post stand out and not blend into the dark background too early.', '2006-07-02 01:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573795, 353440, 61413, '<td valign="top">Well captured. And great colours.<br/> <br/>But the wings seem more like they''re just out of focus, rather than blurred.</td>', 'Well captured. And great colours. But the wings seem more like they''re just out of focus, rather than blurred.', '2006-07-02 01:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573797, 351942, 33400, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image.  It begs many questions.. why is she dressed so nicely while riding a bike? ..Where is she going so intently? ..What is she concentating on?<br/>The B/W was a good idea.  Color would be distracting here.  Nice work.</td>', 'What a beautiful image.  It begs many questions.. why is she dressed so nicely while riding a bike? ..Where is she going so intently? ..What is she concentating on?The B/W was a good idea.  Color would be distracting here.  Nice work.', '2006-07-02 01:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573799, 353137, 29011, '<td valign="top">My favorite motorcycle shot from the challenge. The overall composition is what I like most, great panning too! The background looks great while the bike and biker or sharp. Refreshing to see a different kind of bike shot, not on a traditional race track kind of scenario.</td>', 'My favorite motorcycle shot from the challenge. The overall composition is what I like most, great panning too! The background looks great while the bike and biker or sharp. Refreshing to see a different kind of bike shot, not on a traditional race track kind of scenario.', '2006-07-02 01:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573808, 351943, 29011, '<td valign="top">Fun shot :)<br/> <br/>The arms remind me of moving propellor blades, be careful or you might just take off ;)</td>', 'Fun shot :) The arms remind me of moving propellor blades, be careful or you might just take off ;)', '2006-07-02 01:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573809, 353717, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Good use of colour. I''m not sure that the position of the lower-right mouse is really consistent with the sense of motion that you''re trying to create with the spring, though.</td>', 'Nice photo. Good use of colour. I''m not sure that the position of the lower-right mouse is really consistent with the sense of motion that you''re trying to create with the spring, though.', '2006-07-02 01:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573828, 353015, 61413, '<td valign="top">When I look at this shot, I can hear the skateboard as it clatters back to the ground. Very evocative.<br/> <br/>Some of the background is a little distracting, though. Maybe it would have worked better if the stop-sign had been cropped out, for instance. I can see what you''re trying to do with the stop-sign - with its touch-colour red and the title of the photo - but it isn''t really adding to the scene for me. Maybe if the sign was in focus and more closely juxtaposed with the subject...<br/> <br/>I''d have tried losing the stop-sign and some of the foreground pavement, but leaving the median-strip and parked cars as background, to impart the sense of "urban street scape".<br/> <br/>But for all that, still very evocative.</td>', 'When I look at this shot, I can hear the skateboard as it clatters back to the ground. Very evocative. Some of the background is a little distracting, though. Maybe it would have worked better if the stop-sign had been cropped out, for instance. I can see what you''re trying to do with the stop-sign - with its touch-colour red and the title of the photo - but it isn''t really adding to the scene for me. Maybe if the sign was in focus and more closely juxtaposed with the subject... I''d have tried losing the stop-sign and some of the foreground pavement, but leaving the median-strip and parked cars as background, to impart the sense of "urban street scape". But for all that, still very evocative.', '2006-07-02 01:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573833, 351911, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice sense of motion with the backround and foreleg blur.<br/> <br/>I can''t help but feel that it might have worked better in colour. There would surely have been some very rich browns and greens to work with.</td>', 'A nice sense of motion with the backround and foreleg blur. I can''t help but feel that it might have worked better in colour. There would surely have been some very rich browns and greens to work with.', '2006-07-02 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573842, 353202, 61413, '<td valign="top">LOL!<br/> <br/>Nicely done. Maybe could''ve done with being slightly less tightly cropped, to capture more of the motion happening just out of shot on the right. And I am left with the impression that I''m looking at a one-armed booty shaker!</td>', 'LOL! Nicely done. Maybe could''ve done with being slightly less tightly cropped, to capture more of the motion happening just out of shot on the right. And I am left with the impression that I''m looking at a one-armed booty shaker!', '2006-07-02 01:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573853, 353447, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice juxtaposition of the headlight trails with the "bear left" chevrons.<br/> <br/>I think the image could be improved by straightening it, so that the chevrons are properly horizontal. And the exposure of the chevrons is too grainy, and the chevrons themselves too dilapidated, for this to be a really great shot. But take the concept to somewhere where you have some less scruffy roadsigns and a better opportunity to expose the shot well, and you''ll have something good.<br/> <br/>Finally, I can''t help but notice that these look like headlight trails, not tail-light trails. Which of course means that the vehicle would''ve been turning <b><i>right</i></b>! :-)</td>', 'A nice juxtaposition of the headlight trails with the "bear left" chevrons. I think the image could be improved by straightening it, so that the chevrons are properly horizontal. And the exposure of the chevrons is too grainy, and the chevrons themselves too dilapidated, for this to be a really great shot. But take the concept to somewhere where you have some less scruffy roadsigns and a better opportunity to expose the shot well, and you''ll have something good. Finally, I can''t help but notice that these look like headlight trails, not tail-light trails. Which of course means that the vehicle would''ve been turning right! :-)', '2006-07-02 01:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573858, 352198, 61413, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Strong sense of both heat and movement.</td>', 'Lovely shot. Strong sense of both heat and movement.', '2006-07-02 01:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573863, 353297, 61413, '<td valign="top">LOL! Great concept, well executed. Maybe could''ve done a little more with the lighting of the subjects in the background.</td>', 'LOL! Great concept, well executed. Maybe could''ve done a little more with the lighting of the subjects in the background.', '2006-07-02 01:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573871, 353296, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice execution of the technique - and effective use of duotone.<br/> <br/>A shame that one of the keys is slightly clipped at the top of the pic. And, for me, just a little off the mark in terms of evoking a sense of anything...</td>', 'A nice execution of the technique - and effective use of duotone. A shame that one of the keys is slightly clipped at the top of the pic. And, for me, just a little off the mark in terms of evoking a sense of anything...', '2006-07-02 01:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573874, 353753, 61413, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of colour. Everything works to draw the eye to the spindle, keeping it pleasantly amused along the way.<br/> <br/>The contribution of motion blur to this is subtle, but effective.</td>', 'Lovely use of colour. Everything works to draw the eye to the spindle, keeping it pleasantly amused along the way. The contribution of motion blur to this is subtle, but effective.', '2006-07-02 01:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573877, 352738, 61413, '<td valign="top">This shot works well.<br/> <br/>I might''ve been inclined to crop away maybe the top quarter or third of the trees, just to make the photo a little less "half and half", and to emphasise the idea of the stream emerging from the wooded darkness. But the sense of motion in the water is strong - as is the "primeval" feel of it all, enhanced by nice touches such as the moss on the rocks.</td>', 'This shot works well. I might''ve been inclined to crop away maybe the top quarter or third of the trees, just to make the photo a little less "half and half", and to emphasise the idea of the stream emerging from the wooded darkness. But the sense of motion in the water is strong - as is the "primeval" feel of it all, enhanced by nice touches such as the moss on the rocks.', '2006-07-02 01:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573881, 352294, 61413, '<td valign="top">The photo works well; but the title detracts a little, I think.<br/> <br/>I like the dark, satanic feel of the photo - darkness, anger, grit; all emphasised by the strong reds. Well done. But find a title that plays to these themes - "Hulk in training" is too flippant.</td>', 'The photo works well; but the title detracts a little, I think. I like the dark, satanic feel of the photo - darkness, anger, grit; all emphasised by the strong reds. Well done. But find a title that plays to these themes - "Hulk in training" is too flippant.', '2006-07-02 01:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573884, 353413, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The sense of movement in the water loses momentum in the lower third of the shot, though; which leaves it a bit thematically disjointed to my eye.</td>', 'Nice shot. The sense of movement in the water loses momentum in the lower third of the shot, though; which leaves it a bit thematically disjointed to my eye.', '2006-07-02 01:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573894, 350203, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, a bit overdone. Maybe a <i>slightly</i> faster exposure would have worked better - still enough blur to create the sense of a fast break, without it being all blur and no substance.</td>', 'A nice idea, a bit overdone. Maybe a slightly faster exposure would have worked better - still enough blur to create the sense of a fast break, without it being all blur and no substance.', '2006-07-02 01:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573899, 353714, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and framed. The concept has been done once or twice before, though.<br/> <br/>To get more sense of movement in the hair: use a slower exposure, and take the shot once your subject has stopped moving her head but while the hair is still moving. Slower exposure means you''ll need to use a natural light source, though; flash will be too fast.</td>', 'Nicely lit and framed. The concept has been done once or twice before, though. To get more sense of movement in the hair: use a slower exposure, and take the shot once your subject has stopped moving her head but while the hair is still moving. Slower exposure means you''ll need to use a natural light source, though; flash will be too fast.', '2006-07-02 02:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573901, 353383, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Doesn''t quite come off, though.</td>', 'Nice idea. Doesn''t quite come off, though.', '2006-07-02 02:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573903, 351904, 61413, '<td valign="top">This could''ve been a great shot. If only it had been a little closer to the suject, and without that barrier in the foreground.</td>', 'This could''ve been a great shot. If only it had been a little closer to the suject, and without that barrier in the foreground.', '2006-07-02 02:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573905, 353616, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed - rotational blur in the wheels, linear background blur, the car over to the right creating a sense of the camera struggling to keep up (even though you clearly weren''t, judging by how crisp the car is).<br/> <br/>Just not quite enough happening for my tastes.</td>', 'Nicely executed - rotational blur in the wheels, linear background blur, the car over to the right creating a sense of the camera struggling to keep up (even though you clearly weren''t, judging by how crisp the car is). Just not quite enough happening for my tastes.', '2006-07-02 02:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573917, 352984, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of movement in the cab. The bright colours of the cab juxtapose well with the dayglo jacket of the cop. And there''s just enough "other stuff" happening in a subdued way in the background to create the right sense of "busy street scene".<br/> <br/>I like it.</td>', 'Nice sense of movement in the cab. The bright colours of the cab juxtapose well with the dayglo jacket of the cop. And there''s just enough "other stuff" happening in a subdued way in the background to create the right sense of "busy street scene". I like it.', '2006-07-02 02:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573923, 353263, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Striking use of colour, supported by understated use of fish-eyed "cityscape" in the background.<br/> <br/>I am left vaguely wondering just what is happening in this shot, though...</td>', 'Nicely done. Striking use of colour, supported by understated use of fish-eyed "cityscape" in the background. I am left vaguely wondering just what is happening in this shot, though...', '2006-07-02 02:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573927, 353388, 61413, '<td valign="top">This photo is incongruous. The distant background suggests speed, although the car itself appears to be stationary - there is no sense of the wheels or the road moving.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure what I''m supposed to make of this.</td>', 'This photo is incongruous. The distant background suggests speed, although the car itself appears to be stationary - there is no sense of the wheels or the road moving. I''m not sure what I''m supposed to make of this.', '2006-07-02 02:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573932, 353746, 61413, '<td valign="top">A great shot.<br/> <br/>The mood of the sky matches that on the face of the subject, and the whole thing is enhanced with the colour desturation. Just the right amount of blur (and colour) in the ball to emphasise that it is the only non-stationary element.</td>', 'A great shot. The mood of the sky matches that on the face of the subject, and the whole thing is enhanced with the colour desturation. Just the right amount of blur (and colour) in the ball to emphasise that it is the only non-stationary element.', '2006-07-02 02:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573942, 353513, 48762, '<td valign="top">AYE!  CORRA,MIJO! CORRA,MIJO! Los Arboles de los muertos estan <b>A-Q-U-I!</b></td>', 'AYE!  CORRA,MIJO! CORRA,MIJO! Los Arboles de los muertos estan A-Q-U-I!', '2006-07-02 02:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573944, 352659, 61413, '<td valign="top">This would have worked much better if either the canoeist or the water was unblurred. Difficult to achieve, for sure (I''m not even sure if blurred canoeist, unblurred water would be possible); but it would have made for a spectacular shot.<br/> <br/>As it is, it''s all just blurred, I''m afraid.</td>', 'This would have worked much better if either the canoeist or the water was unblurred. Difficult to achieve, for sure (I''m not even sure if blurred canoeist, unblurred water would be possible); but it would have made for a spectacular shot. As it is, it''s all just blurred, I''m afraid.', '2006-07-02 02:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573947, 349735, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. Nice colours. A simple idea, well executed.</td>', 'Nice effect. Nice colours. A simple idea, well executed.', '2006-07-02 02:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573955, 351323, 61413, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great idea, but this shot doesn''t quite carry it off. The string just looks blurred, rather than in motion.<br/> <br/>Maybe what is needed is a slow exposure under a strobe light, to capture the vibrating string more clearly (though still <i>a little</i> blurred, I''m thinking) at a number of different points in its oscillation.</td>', 'I think this is a great idea, but this shot doesn''t quite carry it off. The string just looks blurred, rather than in motion. Maybe what is needed is a slow exposure under a strobe light, to capture the vibrating string more clearly (though still a little blurred, I''m thinking) at a number of different points in its oscillation.', '2006-07-02 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573959, 351943, 61413, '<td valign="top">It must''ve been tricky getting the subject holding so still, apart from his arms.<br/> <br/>The effect works quite well, although the photo overall is a little flat.</td>', 'It must''ve been tricky getting the subject holding so still, apart from his arms. The effect works quite well, although the photo overall is a little flat.', '2006-07-02 02:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573966, 353305, 61413, '<td valign="top">There''s a great sense of the speed of the knife in this photo. It could''ve been cropped a little more tightly, I think; I''m not sure that the bowl on the right really adds anything.<br/> <br/>I''ve got one of those chopping boards - they''re almost impossible to clean properly once they''ve got a few knife marks in them, eh?</td>', 'There''s a great sense of the speed of the knife in this photo. It could''ve been cropped a little more tightly, I think; I''m not sure that the bowl on the right really adds anything. I''ve got one of those chopping boards - they''re almost impossible to clean properly once they''ve got a few knife marks in them, eh?', '2006-07-02 02:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573968, 352819, 61413, '<td valign="top">The blur of the calf adds to the background and wheel blurs to add to the sense of motion here - evocative. And the slight uphill angle to the road plays nicely to the title of the shot.</td>', 'The blur of the calf adds to the background and wheel blurs to add to the sense of motion here - evocative. And the slight uphill angle to the road plays nicely to the title of the shot.', '2006-07-02 02:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573972, 353591, 61413, '<td valign="top">Very evocative of dusk and urban decay. I am finding the yellow lines distracting as I look at it, though. I think there''s a very strong sense of the cab "descending" into something, without the added emphasis that the yellow lines provide.</td>', 'Very evocative of dusk and urban decay. I am finding the yellow lines distracting as I look at it, though. I think there''s a very strong sense of the cab "descending" into something, without the added emphasis that the yellow lines provide.', '2006-07-02 02:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573973, 353403, 61413, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the runner''s almost entirely out of shot. I think it would have worked better if we''d seen a little more of him/her.</td>', 'It''s a shame the runner''s almost entirely out of shot. I think it would have worked better if we''d seen a little more of him/her.', '2006-07-02 02:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573979, 353393, 61413, '<td valign="top">This works well. The colours are strong, but plausible (just). The blur doesn''t detract from or overwhelm the balls themselves, but just imparts a sense of violent movement from the break. Nicely done.</td>', 'This works well. The colours are strong, but plausible (just). The blur doesn''t detract from or overwhelm the balls themselves, but just imparts a sense of violent movement from the break. Nicely done.', '2006-07-02 02:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573988, 353404, 61413, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t work for me, I''m afraid. The milky texture of the water doesn''t sit well with the bleakness of the rocks.<br/> <br/>There''s an easy "wow" factor to be had from a slow exposure of running water, but something more is needed to make a really great photo.</td>', 'This one doesn''t work for me, I''m afraid. The milky texture of the water doesn''t sit well with the bleakness of the rocks. There''s an easy "wow" factor to be had from a slow exposure of running water, but something more is needed to make a really great photo.', '2006-07-02 02:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2573995, 353716, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a really striking photo. I''m not sure the title works - to me, "rush hour" suggests lots of cars moving very slowly; but these ones seem to be hurtling along.<br/> <br/>Technically, there are some areas where it could improve. It would''ve been good to have seen more of the road and the cars - maybe had the camera angled down a little more. And maybe had one of the cars looking quite crisp, with some obvious speed blur in the others.<br/> <br/>But sriking, nonetheless.</td>', 'This is a really striking photo. I''m not sure the title works - to me, "rush hour" suggests lots of cars moving very slowly; but these ones seem to be hurtling along. Technically, there are some areas where it could improve. It would''ve been good to have seen more of the road and the cars - maybe had the camera angled down a little more. And maybe had one of the cars looking quite crisp, with some obvious speed blur in the others. But sriking, nonetheless.', '2006-07-02 03:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574001, 353137, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice clean shot, with the right amounts of colour, crispness and blur in all the right places.<br/> <br/>The angle of the composition detracts, though; makes the whole thing look a little implausible.</td>', 'A nice clean shot, with the right amounts of colour, crispness and blur in all the right places. The angle of the composition detracts, though; makes the whole thing look a little implausible.', '2006-07-02 03:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574008, 351895, 61413, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Totally contrived, of course; but beautiful, nonetheless.<br/> <br/>The two horizontal lines work well, as does the vivid colours of the train. The position of the subject - very close to, but not quite, in the dead-centre of the shot - does bug me somehow. Maybe it needs to be more obviously asymmetrical.</td>', 'Beautiful. Totally contrived, of course; but beautiful, nonetheless. The two horizontal lines work well, as does the vivid colours of the train. The position of the subject - very close to, but not quite, in the dead-centre of the shot - does bug me somehow. Maybe it needs to be more obviously asymmetrical.', '2006-07-02 03:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574014, 353520, 61413, '<td valign="top">The sub-framing is an interesting technique. The juxtaposition of the sub-frames is pleasing to the eye, but I don''t see anything within the sub-frames that "justifies" them.<br/> <br/>I think it''s a great idea, but this is not the right shot for it.</td>', 'The sub-framing is an interesting technique. The juxtaposition of the sub-frames is pleasing to the eye, but I don''t see anything within the sub-frames that "justifies" them. I think it''s a great idea, but this is not the right shot for it.', '2006-07-02 03:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574027, 351741, 61413, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot - very spiritual. All the elements come together nicely, although I would have cropped it a little differently:<br/>1. I''d have got rid of at least half of the sky. It definitely enhances the mood and is essential to the overall effect, but there''s just too much of it.<br/>2. I think I''d have cropped more tightly on the right, and have given the blurred running suject some more space to run into on the left. (I would need to try it to know if this would really have improved things, though.)<br/> <br/>But still a lovely shot.</td>', 'A lovely shot - very spiritual. All the elements come together nicely, although I would have cropped it a little differently:1. I''d have got rid of at least half of the sky. It definitely enhances the mood and is essential to the overall effect, but there''s just too much of it.2. I think I''d have cropped more tightly on the right, and have given the blurred running suject some more space to run into on the left. (I would need to try it to know if this would really have improved things, though.) But still a lovely shot.', '2006-07-02 03:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574043, 352736, 61413, '<td valign="top">There''s a good concept in here, trying to get out. I don''t think this really carries it off, though. There''s just too much movement.<br/> <br/>Maybe having the subjects hold a tableau for the first part of the exposure; then move, but leave their feet in place. There are lots of things you could try - there''s a great photo in there somewhere!</td>', 'There''s a good concept in here, trying to get out. I don''t think this really carries it off, though. There''s just too much movement. Maybe having the subjects hold a tableau for the first part of the exposure; then move, but leave their feet in place. There are lots of things you could try - there''s a great photo in there somewhere!', '2006-07-02 03:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574060, 353348, 61413, '<td valign="top">LOL!<br/> <br/>Not a lot of speed-blurring going on though, eh?</td>', 'LOL! Not a lot of speed-blurring going on though, eh?', '2006-07-02 03:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574069, 353614, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot of the waterfall, the curving flow of the water is quite hypnotic. I think that having the boy in motion detracts from it quite markedly, though. If he''d been static, it would have been a winner, in my mind.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot of the waterfall, the curving flow of the water is quite hypnotic. I think that having the boy in motion detracts from it quite markedly, though. If he''d been static, it would have been a winner, in my mind.', '2006-07-02 03:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574077, 353704, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice shot. I would have chosen a different angle to photo the car, to get better lighting - with all the light falling on the far side of the car, the image looks quite flat. I think I''d have cropped it a little tighter as well - still kep the strong horizontal line elements, but tightened it up just a little.</td>', 'A nice shot. I would have chosen a different angle to photo the car, to get better lighting - with all the light falling on the far side of the car, the image looks quite flat. I think I''d have cropped it a little tighter as well - still kep the strong horizontal line elements, but tightened it up just a little.', '2006-07-02 03:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574084, 353168, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nicely framed shot. It''s a shame the lighting isn''t stronger, and that the shutter speed wasn''t just a tad faster to allow us to see just a little more detail on the roller-coaster going by. And, of course, having a few people in the roller-coaster...</td>', 'A nicely framed shot. It''s a shame the lighting isn''t stronger, and that the shutter speed wasn''t just a tad faster to allow us to see just a little more detail on the roller-coaster going by. And, of course, having a few people in the roller-coaster...', '2006-07-02 03:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574094, 353472, 61413, '<td valign="top">A good concept. But the hair needs to be speed-blurred, rather than just out of focus, to carry it off. Some more lighting on the face would''ve helped too, I think.</td>', 'A good concept. But the hair needs to be speed-blurred, rather than just out of focus, to carry it off. Some more lighting on the face would''ve helped too, I think.', '2006-07-02 03:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574099, 351741, 35274, '<td valign="top">interesting. i''m not sure whether that large mount thiny to the right adds or subtracts from the composition. i like it tho.</td>', 'interesting. i''m not sure whether that large mount thiny to the right adds or subtracts from the composition. i like it tho.', '2006-07-02 03:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574100, 353324, 35274, '<td valign="top">Haha! the return on the nuns! awsome :D Must''ve been interesting to shoot, lol</td>', 'Haha! the return on the nuns! awsome :D Must''ve been interesting to shoot, lol', '2006-07-02 03:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574111, 353161, 61413, '<td valign="top">I think there''s a great idea lurking here, and you very nearly carried it off.<br/> <br/>Both tail-light trails and running water have been done to death, of course; but bringing them together like this has a lot of promise. If we had seen the full sweep of the tail-light trail, all the way from from bottom-left, this shot would have been right up there. Particularly given the very competent "fast water, slow exposure" treatment in the upper-right two-thirds of the shot.<br/> <br/>Great idea - very close.</td>', 'I think there''s a great idea lurking here, and you very nearly carried it off. Both tail-light trails and running water have been done to death, of course; but bringing them together like this has a lot of promise. If we had seen the full sweep of the tail-light trail, all the way from from bottom-left, this shot would have been right up there. Particularly given the very competent "fast water, slow exposure" treatment in the upper-right two-thirds of the shot. Great idea - very close.', '2006-07-02 03:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574116, 352846, 61413, '<td valign="top">Great. Love it.<br/> <br/>This one captures just about the right amount of rotational blur in the wheels to complement the directional blur of the background.<br/> <br/>It''s a shot that''s been done a million times before, of course. But this one is exceptionally well done, to my eye.<br/> <br/>I wonder, though, whether the reds are maybe just a bit overcooked? I''d have to see it with the reds toned down a little to decide...</td>', 'Great. Love it. This one captures just about the right amount of rotational blur in the wheels to complement the directional blur of the background. It''s a shot that''s been done a million times before, of course. But this one is exceptionally well done, to my eye. I wonder, though, whether the reds are maybe just a bit overcooked? I''d have to see it with the reds toned down a little to decide...', '2006-07-02 03:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574119, 353054, 61413, '<td valign="top">I''ve no idea what this is, but it is very evocative of movement. Liquid, wind, ethereal.<br/> <br/>I''d love to know how you did it.</td>', 'I''ve no idea what this is, but it is very evocative of movement. Liquid, wind, ethereal. I''d love to know how you did it.', '2006-07-02 03:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574120, 353434, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice sense of motion here. And, if you''ll excuse the pun, the image flows nicely - drawing the eye from the relatively low-key water flow at the top to the maelstrom at the bottom.<br/> <br/>Could''ve maybe benefited from some more striking lighting, but we don''t always have much control over that for outside shots, eh?</td>', 'A nice sense of motion here. And, if you''ll excuse the pun, the image flows nicely - drawing the eye from the relatively low-key water flow at the top to the maelstrom at the bottom. Could''ve maybe benefited from some more striking lighting, but we don''t always have much control over that for outside shots, eh?', '2006-07-02 03:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574290, 351942, 21375, '<td valign="top">Love the photo, but I do not understand the title.</td>', 'Love the photo, but I do not understand the title.', '2006-07-02 07:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574291, 353403, 60687, '<td valign="top">fantastic photo</td>', 'fantastic photo', '2006-07-02 07:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574295, 353514, 21375, '<td valign="top">Good photo for the front of the automaker''s brochure.</td>', 'Good photo for the front of the automaker''s brochure.', '2006-07-02 07:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574367, 353440, 56658, '<td valign="top">great job. I didn''t even know they looked like that on thier head.</td>', 'great job. I didn''t even know they looked like that on thier head.', '2006-07-02 09:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574373, 353513, 56658, '<td valign="top">I don''t see that the motion blur serves any purpose in the photo. sorry not working for me, but good job on getting the effect leaglly.</td>', 'I don''t see that the motion blur serves any purpose in the photo. sorry not working for me, but good job on getting the effect leaglly.', '2006-07-02 09:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574390, 353324, 27763, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  Love their poses!  This photo would probably ribbon in the "Renegade Nuns" challenge.</td>', 'Hilarious!  Love their poses!  This photo would probably ribbon in the "Renegade Nuns" challenge.', '2006-07-02 09:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574400, 353740, 27763, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I know what this is!  I like the effect you got towards the top of the photo.  I think I would have titled it something like "Wormhole" or "Alien Invasion".  It looks like the people are about to be sucked up into the hole.</td>', 'Hey!  I know what this is!  I like the effect you got towards the top of the photo.  I think I would have titled it something like "Wormhole" or "Alien Invasion".  It looks like the people are about to be sucked up into the hole.', '2006-07-02 09:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574408, 353323, 27763, '<td valign="top">Cute.  But I think he should be moving, too (trying to avoid the pan), and he should have a grimace on his face instead of a blank expression.  Still a cute shot.</td>', 'Cute.  But I think he should be moving, too (trying to avoid the pan), and he should have a grimace on his face instead of a blank expression.  Still a cute shot.', '2006-07-02 09:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574423, 351323, 27763, '<td valign="top">Nice tight crop.  I think I would have cleaned the guitar first, though.  Looks a bit crusty.</td>', 'Nice tight crop.  I think I would have cleaned the guitar first, though.  Looks a bit crusty.', '2006-07-02 09:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574425, 353397, 27763, '<td valign="top">Good one.  I like it.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Good one.  I like it.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-07-02 09:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574428, 353459, 27763, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Reminds me of a Dax shot.  Good light and mood.  Nice title, too.</td>', 'Nice.  Reminds me of a Dax shot.  Good light and mood.  Nice title, too.', '2006-07-02 09:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574478, 353440, 18367, '<td valign="top">The details in this image are simply stunning.  I can hardly wait till the results are in to find out what lens you used in this instance.  This is definitely a winner in my books.  Good luck in the challenge</td>', 'The details in this image are simply stunning.  I can hardly wait till the results are in to find out what lens you used in this instance.  This is definitely a winner in my books.  Good luck in the challenge', '2006-07-02 10:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574490, 353137, 33672, '<td valign="top">Excellent comp and clarity.</td>', 'Excellent comp and clarity.', '2006-07-02 10:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574492, 353734, 33672, '<td valign="top">great photo. The compa colors and clarity are great. Nice job!</td>', 'great photo. The compa colors and clarity are great. Nice job!', '2006-07-02 10:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574512, 353119, 61413, '<td valign="top">Wow. Love it! I''ve no idea what it is, but I love it.<br/> <br/>Very rich, with a sense of detail just out of reach in the reflection in the globe. The blue and red circular blurs certainly impart a sense of speed.</td>', 'Wow. Love it! I''ve no idea what it is, but I love it. Very rich, with a sense of detail just out of reach in the reflection in the globe. The blue and red circular blurs certainly impart a sense of speed.', '2006-07-02 10:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574514, 353742, 61413, '<td valign="top">By the time I get through rating photos for this challenge, I will be well and truly <b><i>over</i></b> waterfall shots!!<br/> <br/>But this one is a beautiful example of the genre. Free falling water spray at the top, solid flowing water in the middle, breaking over rocks at the bottom. All nicely framed, with the static elements crisp, perfectly exposed and emphatically moist. Enhanced with just the right amount of exaggeration in the colour.<br/> <br/>I''ll give it a 10.</td>', 'By the time I get through rating photos for this challenge, I will be well and truly over waterfall shots!! But this one is a beautiful example of the genre. Free falling water spray at the top, solid flowing water in the middle, breaking over rocks at the bottom. All nicely framed, with the static elements crisp, perfectly exposed and emphatically moist. Enhanced with just the right amount of exaggeration in the colour. I''ll give it a 10.', '2006-07-02 10:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574515, 352512, 61413, '<td valign="top">Oh no, yet another waterfall shot!! :-)<br/> <br/>But I like the use of the two huge rocks to guide your eye into the waterfall itself. And the use of slow exposure to provide the misty feel to the water and the extended depth of field for the static elements. It all works well together to create a powerfully primeval, spiritual result.</td>', 'Oh no, yet another waterfall shot!! :-) But I like the use of the two huge rocks to guide your eye into the waterfall itself. And the use of slow exposure to provide the misty feel to the water and the extended depth of field for the static elements. It all works well together to create a powerfully primeval, spiritual result.', '2006-07-02 10:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574659, 353730, 48228, '<td valign="top">I actually like thiss one quite a lot..... it just works for me re motion blur.....</td>', 'I actually like thiss one quite a lot..... it just works for me re motion blur.....', '2006-07-02 12:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574666, 353742, 48228, '<td valign="top">Stunning.....</td>', 'Stunning.....', '2006-07-02 12:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574680, 353348, 48228, '<td valign="top">Clever.....</td>', 'Clever.....', '2006-07-02 12:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
