(2574800, 352882, 52765, '<td valign="top">to small, need to be 640 on the longest side</td>', 'to small, need to be 640 on the longest side', '2006-07-02 13:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574820, 353716, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture. I am assuming it is an IR shot with the colors of the trees whizzing by. I like that the horizon is not level in this one. It just offers a cool perspective. Good shot and bumping up.</td>', 'Very interesting capture. I am assuming it is an IR shot with the colors of the trees whizzing by. I like that the horizon is not level in this one. It just offers a cool perspective. Good shot and bumping up.', '2006-07-02 14:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574822, 352738, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and serene capture here. I like that you didnt leave the shutter open too long and lose too much detail on the running water.</td>', 'Very pretty and serene capture here. I like that you didnt leave the shutter open too long and lose too much detail on the running water.', '2006-07-02 14:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574829, 352486, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cool fantasy like shot. The color tones are nice. I realize that this is a long exposure and you caught alot of movement of the water but it may have blurred to a point where it is almsot too smooth for this challenge. I like this shot and gave it a 7 anyways.</td>', 'Cool fantasy like shot. The color tones are nice. I realize that this is a long exposure and you caught alot of movement of the water but it may have blurred to a point where it is almsot too smooth for this challenge. I like this shot and gave it a 7 anyways.', '2006-07-02 14:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574853, 353348, 53147, '<td valign="top">LOL - funny shot.</td>', 'LOL - funny shot.', '2006-07-02 14:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574872, 352722, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice capture -- I didn''t think of fish ... : )</td>', 'Nice capture -- I didn''t think of fish ... : )', '2006-07-02 14:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574880, 353308, 1031, '<td valign="top">From that spot I think you might have been able to make it a one-rail shot off the far end, but three-rails makes a nice effect : )<br/> <br/>Hopefully you''ll reveal how many attempts this took ... and whether the Eight-ball went in ....</td>', 'From that spot I think you might have been able to make it a one-rail shot off the far end, but three-rails makes a nice effect : ) Hopefully you''ll reveal how many attempts this took ... and whether the Eight-ball went in ....', '2006-07-02 15:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574881, 353412, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2006-07-02 15:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574891, 353348, 29011, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot! :) Very neat concept. All looks great except the back wheel which looks static.</td>', 'What a fun shot! :) Very neat concept. All looks great except the back wheel which looks static.', '2006-07-02 15:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574895, 353714, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and overall composition. There is some slight motion blur would''ve liked to see more for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea and overall composition. There is some slight motion blur would''ve liked to see more for this challenge.', '2006-07-02 15:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574897, 353486, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot. Would only recommend to dodge or paint over the top left corner, there''s some purple there.</td>', 'Nice simple shot. Would only recommend to dodge or paint over the top left corner, there''s some purple there.', '2006-07-02 15:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574900, 353716, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice effect -- if you shot this from your car, you might want to submit it to the <a href="//www.windscreen.tv/submit.php" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Windscreen Photo Gallery</a>.</td>', 'Nice effect -- if you shot this from your car, you might want to submit it to the Windscreen Photo Gallery.', '2006-07-02 15:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574926, 351891, 61244, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blur. Im not overly fond of the colors though. just my .02</td>', 'Nice use of blur. Im not overly fond of the colors though. just my .02', '2006-07-02 15:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574932, 353488, 61244, '<td valign="top">Great sports photo - personally I would have liked to see at least something be in focus though.</td>', 'Great sports photo - personally I would have liked to see at least something be in focus though.', '2006-07-02 15:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574933, 353154, 61244, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. decent blur. would have liked to see a tighter crop.</td>', 'Nice photo. decent blur. would have liked to see a tighter crop.', '2006-07-02 15:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574939, 351942, 61244, '<td valign="top">nicely done motion blur. for a black and white this has a lot of grey.</td>', 'nicely done motion blur. for a black and white this has a lot of grey.', '2006-07-02 15:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574945, 353249, 61244, '<td valign="top">decent use of blur.<br/>At first I hated the angle used. But the more I look at it - the more I feel like Im in a constant state of imbalance and with that you have captured the feeling of whitewater. great job</td>', 'decent use of blur.At first I hated the angle used. But the more I look at it - the more I feel like Im in a constant state of imbalance and with that you have captured the feeling of whitewater. great job', '2006-07-02 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574946, 353015, 61439, '<td valign="top">pretty nice shot, i just don''t like those color signs upper left hand corner. also pitty it''s flatground. but overall, pretty much like it!</td>', 'pretty nice shot, i just don''t like those color signs upper left hand corner. also pitty it''s flatground. but overall, pretty much like it!', '2006-07-02 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574955, 349735, 61244, '<td valign="top">It would have been more interesting in the blur were offset, more directional. <br/>my appologies for previous comments - I misunderstood how this was achieved.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-03 13:55:47.</i></td>', 'It would have been more interesting in the blur were offset, more directional. my appologies for previous comments - I misunderstood how this was achieved.', '2006-07-02 15:51:18.000000', '2006-07-03 14:55:47.000000', 1),
(2574957, 351911, 61244, '<td valign="top">an excellant photo but nothing is in focus</td>', 'an excellant photo but nothing is in focus', '2006-07-02 15:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574959, 353614, 61244, '<td valign="top">the other photos where nothing was in focus - I was not fond of because it seemed in error. I actually like the continual motion on this one. Nice job.</td>', 'the other photos where nothing was in focus - I was not fond of because it seemed in error. I actually like the continual motion on this one. Nice job.', '2006-07-02 15:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574964, 353635, 61244, '<td valign="top">ouch! This could be a very VERY successful photo if you reshoot without the flash blowing your image. Worst case scenario - put a plastic bag over your flash.</td>', 'ouch! This could be a very VERY successful photo if you reshoot without the flash blowing your image. Worst case scenario - put a plastic bag over your flash.', '2006-07-02 15:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574966, 351895, 61244, '<td valign="top">the color separation is in a perfect position it works wonders on your photo.</td>', 'the color separation is in a perfect position it works wonders on your photo.', '2006-07-02 15:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2574972, 353440, 61244, '<td valign="top">I think you have a winner here. This is SIMPLY STUNNING! If only the background did more for your photo. That beige is not very flattering. But your use of motion blur is amazing/</td>', 'I think you have a winner here. This is SIMPLY STUNNING! If only the background did more for your photo. That beige is not very flattering. But your use of motion blur is amazing/', '2006-07-02 15:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575037, 353569, 29011, '<td valign="top">All that energy! Really nice action pan. One of my faves from the challenge. Hope this does well :)</td>', 'All that energy! Really nice action pan. One of my faves from the challenge. Hope this does well :)', '2006-07-02 16:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575038, 351272, 29011, '<td valign="top">Cool splash! Nice take on the waterfront :)</td>', 'Cool splash! Nice take on the waterfront :)', '2006-07-02 16:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575048, 352311, 29011, '<td valign="top">What an original capture. Would usually expect this to shot in total stop action style where there''s no blur at all but this has a totally different effect, which I really like. Great work.</td>', 'What an original capture. Would usually expect this to shot in total stop action style where there''s no blur at all but this has a totally different effect, which I really like. Great work.', '2006-07-02 16:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575049, 352722, 29011, '<td valign="top">Not easy catching these fiesty fish in motion, really immpresive pan here.</td>', 'Not easy catching these fiesty fish in motion, really immpresive pan here.', '2006-07-02 16:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575055, 352902, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great find! A very unique and interesting scene to come across. I think this shot would''ve worked better without the motion blur to bird''s head, the blur actually detracts from the overall image.</td>', 'Great find! A very unique and interesting scene to come across. I think this shot would''ve worked better without the motion blur to bird''s head, the blur actually detracts from the overall image.', '2006-07-02 16:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575078, 349735, 3837, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and inviting night.</td>', 'Beautiful light and inviting night.', '2006-07-02 17:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575102, 353440, 55621, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  Little buggers are hard to photograph!</td>', 'Very nice capture.  Little buggers are hard to photograph!', '2006-07-02 17:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575106, 353404, 55621, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph.  I especially like having the falls off set to the center of the image.  Would love to see this place in person.</td>', 'Excellent photograph.  I especially like having the falls off set to the center of the image.  Would love to see this place in person.', '2006-07-02 17:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575108, 353215, 55621, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photograph.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photograph.', '2006-07-02 17:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575110, 353742, 55621, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and a perfect exposure of the falls.</td>', 'Excellent colors and a perfect exposure of the falls.', '2006-07-02 17:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575117, 353406, 55621, '<td valign="top">This is overall an excellent image.  Your model is elegant and graceful looking and the background colors are perfect.</td>', 'This is overall an excellent image.  Your model is elegant and graceful looking and the background colors are perfect.', '2006-07-02 17:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575119, 353614, 55621, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and great use of light.  Would enjoy seeing this with just the falls.</td>', 'Nice composition and great use of light.  Would enjoy seeing this with just the falls.', '2006-07-02 17:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575125, 352659, 55621, '<td valign="top">Great photograph.  Takes me back to my whitewater days.  The flow of the river, the temperature of the water and the sheer adrenalin.</td>', 'Great photograph.  Takes me back to my whitewater days.  The flow of the river, the temperature of the water and the sheer adrenalin.', '2006-07-02 17:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575126, 353323, 55621, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to know I''m not the only one this happens too...</td>', 'I''m glad to know I''m not the only one this happens too...', '2006-07-02 17:26:03.000000', NULL, 1);
