(2575191, 353514, 3214, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, not just a motion blur but one with scenic appeal and good composition.</td>', 'Very nicely done, not just a motion blur but one with scenic appeal and good composition.', '2006-07-02 17:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575192, 353730, 3837, '<td valign="top">The idea really works for this challenge.</td>', 'The idea really works for this challenge.', '2006-07-02 17:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575196, 353569, 3837, '<td valign="top">You should be proud of this beautiful animal shot.  It''s an incredible memento of someone''s pet.  But it seems a bit much - like the dog is jumping into hyperspace - at least how they do it on TV.</td>', 'You should be proud of this beautiful animal shot.  It''s an incredible memento of someone''s pet.  But it seems a bit much - like the dog is jumping into hyperspace - at least how they do it on TV.', '2006-07-02 17:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575199, 353397, 3837, '<td valign="top">Looks like IR in the dance club - cool.  Noisy photo with character.  True to the spirit of motion with low light a good reason for blur.</td>', 'Looks like IR in the dance club - cool.  Noisy photo with character.  True to the spirit of motion with low light a good reason for blur.', '2006-07-02 17:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575200, 353737, 3214, '<td valign="top">The overly saturated look really works with the chrome!</td>', 'The overly saturated look really works with the chrome!', '2006-07-02 17:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575214, 353663, 55642, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any motion blur here at all. There are also some glare on the toy''s fur. I would prefer to see the toy''s fave in a shot like this.</td>', 'I don''t see any motion blur here at all. There are also some glare on the toy''s fur. I would prefer to see the toy''s fave in a shot like this.', '2006-07-02 17:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575215, 349946, 55642, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure where the motion is in this shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure where the motion is in this shot.', '2006-07-02 18:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575219, 350223, 55642, '<td valign="top">This is very Silence of the Lambs. I would prefer to see a motion blur that is more obviously deliberate. This looks like your hand moved while holding the camera. There is also a LOT of dead space and the centering isn''t the greatest. I would suggest a much tighter crop.</td>', 'This is very Silence of the Lambs. I would prefer to see a motion blur that is more obviously deliberate. This looks like your hand moved while holding the camera. There is also a LOT of dead space and the centering isn''t the greatest. I would suggest a much tighter crop.', '2006-07-02 18:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575220, 353714, 55642, '<td valign="top">Lots of motion, but very little blur. I am also not fond of the blown highlights on her chin and neck.</td>', 'Lots of motion, but very little blur. I am also not fond of the blown highlights on her chin and neck.', '2006-07-02 18:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575222, 353515, 55642, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the motion, but the scene is very bright and the subject is too small.</td>', 'You''ve captured the motion, but the scene is very bright and the subject is too small.', '2006-07-02 18:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575224, 351382, 55642, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I think it suffers a bit in execution. Elements that should be in focus are not, like the lights in the background and the water bottles. The effect looks more like camera shake and accident than a deliberate motion shot.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I think it suffers a bit in execution. Elements that should be in focus are not, like the lights in the background and the water bottles. The effect looks more like camera shake and accident than a deliberate motion shot.', '2006-07-02 18:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575225, 353472, 55642, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lot of dust in the scene, and the bright space to the upper right is overpowering.</td>', 'There seems to be a lot of dust in the scene, and the bright space to the upper right is overpowering.', '2006-07-02 18:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575227, 352294, 55642, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but much too red.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but much too red.', '2006-07-02 18:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575228, 353380, 55642, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity you''ve almost completely lost the rainbow, it would have made this version of a very common concept stand out from the pack.</td>', 'It''s a pity you''ve almost completely lost the rainbow, it would have made this version of a very common concept stand out from the pack.', '2006-07-02 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575229, 353367, 55642, '<td valign="top">The magentas and reds are too oversaturated.</td>', 'The magentas and reds are too oversaturated.', '2006-07-02 18:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575231, 353214, 55642, '<td valign="top">Besides the blown highlights on the truck, I''m not fond of the moving glowsticks(?) in the background.</td>', 'Besides the blown highlights on the truck, I''m not fond of the moving glowsticks(?) in the background.', '2006-07-02 18:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575235, 351360, 55642, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea, but it lacks punch. The colors seem washed out, and while I can see that it''s a man moving around, I can''t tell why or what he''s doing. The motion seems rather purposeless.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea, but it lacks punch. The colors seem washed out, and while I can see that it''s a man moving around, I can''t tell why or what he''s doing. The motion seems rather purposeless.', '2006-07-02 18:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575236, 353486, 55642, '<td valign="top">This would have worked better on a dark background. This is very very bright.</td>', 'This would have worked better on a dark background. This is very very bright.', '2006-07-02 18:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575239, 351746, 55642, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of shot where I would like to see <i>something</i> in the shot in focus, just so that the motion blur looks less accidental. Perhaps the lane dividers.</td>', 'This is the sort of shot where I would like to see something in the shot in focus, just so that the motion blur looks less accidental. Perhaps the lane dividers.', '2006-07-02 18:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575243, 353351, 55642, '<td valign="top">The only blur here is a lack of focus, not due to motion. There''s also quite a bit of artifacting in the blue sky that is distracting. I would crop this a bit tighter, putting the plane in the upper right to utilize the rule of thirds and remove a lot of the dead space in the sky.</td>', 'The only blur here is a lack of focus, not due to motion. There''s also quite a bit of artifacting in the blue sky that is distracting. I would crop this a bit tighter, putting the plane in the upper right to utilize the rule of thirds and remove a lot of the dead space in the sky.', '2006-07-02 18:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575254, 353446, 55642, '<td valign="top">The color seems very washed out and perhaps a bit on the red/purple side? I like the blur of the waves, but the person on the beach and the landscape should be better focused.</td>', 'The color seems very washed out and perhaps a bit on the red/purple side? I like the blur of the waves, but the person on the beach and the landscape should be better focused.', '2006-07-02 18:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575256, 353438, 55642, '<td valign="top">The flower petals are blown out, and the focus seems to be on the green behind it, which distracts from your subject. I would like to see the flower a little more from the front, and the flower center in focus with the bees in motion. A polarizer might help if you''re not already using one.</td>', 'The flower petals are blown out, and the focus seems to be on the green behind it, which distracts from your subject. I would like to see the flower a little more from the front, and the flower center in focus with the bees in motion. A polarizer might help if you''re not already using one.', '2006-07-02 18:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575259, 353146, 55642, '<td valign="top">The light is too harsh. Try shooting at sunrise or sunset, whenever the sun is lower in the sky. The quality of light is much higher for nature shots at those times.</td>', 'The light is too harsh. Try shooting at sunrise or sunset, whenever the sun is lower in the sky. The quality of light is much higher for nature shots at those times.', '2006-07-02 18:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575260, 353468, 55642, '<td valign="top">There is so much going on in this photo that I can''t figure out where I''m supposed to look. I don''t know if I would have guessed what was going on without the title.</td>', 'There is so much going on in this photo that I can''t figure out where I''m supposed to look. I don''t know if I would have guessed what was going on without the title.', '2006-07-02 18:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575262, 353742, 26081, '<td valign="top">Stunning</td>', 'Stunning', '2006-07-02 18:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575265, 352902, 55642, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit harsh here - the bird is quit blown out in several spots. The color is rather blah as well, and I''m sure the light isn''t helping. The motion isn''t really enhancing the photo in any way.</td>', 'The light is a bit harsh here - the bird is quit blown out in several spots. The color is rather blah as well, and I''m sure the light isn''t helping. The motion isn''t really enhancing the photo in any way.', '2006-07-02 18:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575266, 352486, 26081, '<td valign="top">very Mystical great shot</td>', 'very Mystical great shot', '2006-07-02 18:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575270, 352782, 55642, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel as though the blur is enhancing the scene. It looks more accidental than deliberate.</td>', 'I don''t feel as though the blur is enhancing the scene. It looks more accidental than deliberate.', '2006-07-02 18:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575273, 353740, 55642, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit difficult to find a place to focus on here. My eye goes toward the black spots in thye reflective thing, not to the motion blur.</td>', 'It''s a bit difficult to find a place to focus on here. My eye goes toward the black spots in thye reflective thing, not to the motion blur.', '2006-07-02 18:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575275, 353743, 55642, '<td valign="top">I feel as though for this shot something should be in focus. The eye, the muzzle. The blur doesn''t look deliberate and doesn''t enhance the photo.</td>', 'I feel as though for this shot something should be in focus. The eye, the muzzle. The blur doesn''t look deliberate and doesn''t enhance the photo.', '2006-07-02 18:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575279, 353098, 55642, '<td valign="top">Besides the tilted horizon, the kid in the foreground is a bit blown out.</td>', 'Besides the tilted horizon, the kid in the foreground is a bit blown out.', '2006-07-02 18:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575282, 351911, 55642, '<td valign="top">Something in this photo needs to be in focus, like the rider or the horse''s face. As is, the motion doesn''t enhance the photo because it just looks accidental.</td>', 'Something in this photo needs to be in focus, like the rider or the horse''s face. As is, the motion doesn''t enhance the photo because it just looks accidental.', '2006-07-02 18:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575286, 353464, 55642, '<td valign="top">Very blown out. I wouldn''t know what I was looking at without the title. The utility pole on the right border needs to be incorporated into the photo to provide a leading line to the sky.</td>', 'Very blown out. I wouldn''t know what I was looking at without the title. The utility pole on the right border needs to be incorporated into the photo to provide a leading line to the sky.', '2006-07-02 18:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575288, 353635, 55642, '<td valign="top">Too many blown spots here, and the cropping needs to be tighter to exclude the white framing at the bottom and the edges at the upper corners. I would also like to see the color a bit more saturated.</td>', 'Too many blown spots here, and the cropping needs to be tighter to exclude the white framing at the bottom and the edges at the upper corners. I would also like to see the color a bit more saturated.', '2006-07-02 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575292, 353654, 55642, '<td valign="top">There is so much else going on in this photo that the blur is too difficult to find.</td>', 'There is so much else going on in this photo that the blur is too difficult to find.', '2006-07-02 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575300, 352850, 55642, '<td valign="top">Since I''m not sure what I''m looking at, it''s difficult to comment. What is she standing in? I think the obscurity hurts this photo.</td>', 'Since I''m not sure what I''m looking at, it''s difficult to comment. What is she standing in? I think the obscurity hurts this photo.', '2006-07-02 18:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575303, 353054, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting and eye-catching. I love the copper swirl at the horizontal near the bottom. Awesome with the hand and ring in focus. What a great tune - I can just about hear the music! The top 1/4 doesn''t do much for me, but those bottom 3/4 of the image gives you a top score from me.</td>', 'This is very interesting and eye-catching. I love the copper swirl at the horizontal near the bottom. Awesome with the hand and ring in focus. What a great tune - I can just about hear the music! The top 1/4 doesn''t do much for me, but those bottom 3/4 of the image gives you a top score from me.', '2006-07-02 18:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575304, 353308, 55642, '<td valign="top">My eye is immediately drawn to the blown highlight on the front edge of the table. The blur is a neat idea, but perhaps would have been more effective using one of the colored balls since the white just looks like a chalk smear on a worn table.</td>', 'My eye is immediately drawn to the blown highlight on the front edge of the table. The blur is a neat idea, but perhaps would have been more effective using one of the colored balls since the white just looks like a chalk smear on a worn table.', '2006-07-02 18:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575308, 353305, 55642, '<td valign="top">The bowl in the right corner is a big distraction, and the color needs correcting.</td>', 'The bowl in the right corner is a big distraction, and the color needs correcting.', '2006-07-02 18:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575310, 353423, 55642, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this just looks like a bad snapshot. To be effective, this sort of shot needs to have something in focus. The red hat guy''s face would be a good focus point.</td>', 'Sorry, but this just looks like a bad snapshot. To be effective, this sort of shot needs to have something in focus. The red hat guy''s face would be a good focus point.', '2006-07-02 18:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575311, 353153, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the b&amp;w (high key?) treatment a lot. The biker on the left distracts me a bit, especially since the one on the right is so perfect. Nice job overall!</td>', 'I like the b&w (high key?) treatment a lot. The biker on the left distracts me a bit, especially since the one on the right is so perfect. Nice job overall!', '2006-07-02 18:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575313, 353005, 55642, '<td valign="top">The shot is too cyan - look at how turquoise the sky is. I think a hue adjustment would help.</td>', 'The shot is too cyan - look at how turquoise the sky is. I think a hue adjustment would help.', '2006-07-02 18:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575315, 353751, 55642, '<td valign="top">Too much negative space, and the blue flare at the bottom is distracting.</td>', 'Too much negative space, and the blue flare at the bottom is distracting.', '2006-07-02 18:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575319, 352882, 55642, '<td valign="top">The photo is just too small for the level of detail.</td>', 'The photo is just too small for the level of detail.', '2006-07-02 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575322, 353748, 31133, '<td valign="top">Great colors and feeling of speed, but for my taste, the image could stand to be cropped at the top to eliminate the distraction areas. This looks like a lot of fun.</td>', 'Great colors and feeling of speed, but for my taste, the image could stand to be cropped at the top to eliminate the distraction areas. This looks like a lot of fun.', '2006-07-02 18:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575323, 353101, 55642, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the grid pattern is, but it''s a very distracting element.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the grid pattern is, but it''s a very distracting element.', '2006-07-02 18:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575324, 353655, 55642, '<td valign="top">I think the water shot was extremely predictable for this challenge, so to do it and make it work, it needed to be really special. This is a nice water motion photo, but there''snothing that sets it apart from the rest. Also, the blur is not as evident as it needs to be.</td>', 'I think the water shot was extremely predictable for this challenge, so to do it and make it work, it needed to be really special. This is a nice water motion photo, but there''snothing that sets it apart from the rest. Also, the blur is not as evident as it needs to be.', '2006-07-02 18:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575325, 351693, 31133, '<td valign="top">Good job with the straightforward composition and colors. I like both of those aspects. However, there is too much Neat Image for my taste and bird seems more out of focus than motion-blurred. The color of the water is very nice.</td>', 'Good job with the straightforward composition and colors. I like both of those aspects. However, there is too much Neat Image for my taste and bird seems more out of focus than motion-blurred. The color of the water is very nice.', '2006-07-02 18:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575326, 352983, 55642, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the motion blur does anything to enhance this photo.</td>', 'I don''t think the motion blur does anything to enhance this photo.', '2006-07-02 18:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575328, 352311, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow, wow - what a capture! This looks very complicated to do. Hope you write about how you did it afterwards in the photog comment area. Even the title is perfect.</td>', 'Wow, wow, wow - what a capture! This looks very complicated to do. Hope you write about how you did it afterwards in the photog comment area. Even the title is perfect.', '2006-07-02 18:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575330, 353154, 31133, '<td valign="top">Cute title :-) Nice shot, too. I''m impressed that you managed to keep the motion blur away from the people inside the restaurant while getting it on the person walking.</td>', 'Cute title :-) Nice shot, too. I''m impressed that you managed to keep the motion blur away from the people inside the restaurant while getting it on the person walking.', '2006-07-02 18:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575333, 353324, 31133, '<td valign="top">This must be coley with that bug and those nuns! Love this to heavenly death, whoever you are. Great poses on the nuns, heeehheee!</td>', 'This must be coley with that bug and those nuns! Love this to heavenly death, whoever you are. Great poses on the nuns, heeehheee!', '2006-07-02 18:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575359, 353323, 26679, '<td valign="top">I know the feeling Alan<br/>Great Idea, painfull capture...</td>', 'I know the feeling AlanGreat Idea, painfull capture...', '2006-07-02 19:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575416, 353393, 55642, '<td valign="top">To the balls really have a color texture? At first I thought they were wet. nice color, good illustration.</td>', 'To the balls really have a color texture? At first I thought they were wet. nice color, good illustration.', '2006-07-02 20:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575418, 353219, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like the way this was done, even though the moving car theme is popular for this challenge. There is a bit too much black negative space, but overall very nice.</td>', 'I like the way this was done, even though the moving car theme is popular for this challenge. There is a bit too much black negative space, but overall very nice.', '2006-07-02 20:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575421, 353362, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh a little too late! I like the humor in this shot, though the bread is a little blown.</td>', 'Nice bokeh a little too late! I like the humor in this shot, though the bread is a little blown.', '2006-07-02 20:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575427, 350203, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice job! One of the better shots of this concept. Good centering, perhaps a smidge too yellow.</td>', 'Nice job! One of the better shots of this concept. Good centering, perhaps a smidge too yellow.', '2006-07-02 20:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575429, 352738, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of textures!</td>', 'Nice contrast of textures!', '2006-07-02 20:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575432, 353616, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like the texture the blur provides.</td>', 'I like the texture the blur provides.', '2006-07-02 20:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575435, 353306, 55642, '<td valign="top">Normally this type of photo would need something in focus to make it look intentional, but the horizontal blur elements really make this photo work.</td>', 'Normally this type of photo would need something in focus to make it look intentional, but the horizontal blur elements really make this photo work.', '2006-07-02 20:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575436, 352338, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice retro feel to this one! Perhaps it would be better centered, square cropped?</td>', 'Nice retro feel to this one! Perhaps it would be better centered, square cropped?', '2006-07-02 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575440, 353403, 55642, '<td valign="top">The richness of the color is nice here, but I''m not not fond of the vignetting around the edges, and the elbow along the left edge is distracting.</td>', 'The richness of the color is nice here, but I''m not not fond of the vignetting around the edges, and the elbow along the left edge is distracting.', '2006-07-02 20:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575443, 353656, 55642, '<td valign="top">A little blown on the log. It''s a nice water motion shot, but I think not enough motion or specialness in a field full of water shots to stand out.</td>', 'A little blown on the log. It''s a nice water motion shot, but I think not enough motion or specialness in a field full of water shots to stand out.', '2006-07-02 20:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575445, 353137, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, the tilt works, perhaps a touch too red.</td>', 'Nice clarity, the tilt works, perhaps a touch too red.', '2006-07-02 20:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575446, 353459, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice to see an original concept in here!</td>', 'Nice to see an original concept in here!', '2006-07-02 20:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575447, 353297, 55642, '<td valign="top">Heheh, cute!</td>', 'Heheh, cute!', '2006-07-02 20:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575449, 349735, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the zoom technique!</td>', 'Nice use of the zoom technique!', '2006-07-02 20:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575450, 351895, 55642, '<td valign="top">Should be Platform 10, just for the subliminal message. Did you see how well that worked in the Bokeh challenge? ;)</td>', 'Should be Platform 10, just for the subliminal message. Did you see how well that worked in the Bokeh challenge? ;)', '2006-07-02 20:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575452, 353440, 55642, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, a ruby-throat! I am such a sucker for hummingbirds. Nice clarity on a speedy subject!</td>', 'Ohhh, a ruby-throat! I am such a sucker for hummingbirds. Nice clarity on a speedy subject!', '2006-07-02 20:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575453, 353012, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like the blast of color. Nice texture on the road.</td>', 'I like the blast of color. Nice texture on the road.', '2006-07-02 20:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575454, 353704, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, perhaps the blur isn''t apparent enough? The horizontal lines are mostly too sharp, especially with nothing to break it up.</td>', 'Nice idea, perhaps the blur isn''t apparent enough? The horizontal lines are mostly too sharp, especially with nothing to break it up.', '2006-07-02 20:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575455, 352736, 55642, '<td valign="top">I love the color on this one. I think it would work better perfectly centered.</td>', 'I love the color on this one. I think it would work better perfectly centered.', '2006-07-02 20:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575457, 353267, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like the water motion, but I''m not sure about the inclusion of the people. It does need some kind of stationary object, though, so I''m not sure how to fix that.</td>', 'I like the water motion, but I''m not sure about the inclusion of the people. It does need some kind of stationary object, though, so I''m not sure how to fix that.', '2006-07-02 20:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575458, 352846, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice color and clarity.</td>', 'Nice color and clarity.', '2006-07-02 20:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575460, 353513, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like that this is a photo implying a deliberately moving photographer instead of a moving subject.</td>', 'I like that this is a photo implying a deliberately moving photographer instead of a moving subject.', '2006-07-02 20:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575461, 353161, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like that it''s a two for one sort of shot, but the colors look too saturated for me. The creek looks like someone dumped a bunch of toilet cleaner in it.</td>', 'I like that it''s a two for one sort of shot, but the colors look too saturated for me. The creek looks like someone dumped a bunch of toilet cleaner in it.', '2006-07-02 20:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575462, 353753, 55642, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the yellows and greens pop a bit more here.</td>', 'I would like to see the yellows and greens pop a bit more here.', '2006-07-02 20:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575463, 353701, 55642, '<td valign="top">I''m generally not a fan of the poker shots, but I like this as a motion concept.</td>', 'I''m generally not a fan of the poker shots, but I like this as a motion concept.', '2006-07-02 20:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575464, 353412, 55642, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, perhaps a little warmer light? A little dodging to bring him out of the shade?</td>', 'Love the idea, perhaps a little warmer light? A little dodging to bring him out of the shade?', '2006-07-02 20:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575466, 353517, 55642, '<td valign="top">This would work better horizontally, I think, and with a sharper focus.</td>', 'This would work better horizontally, I think, and with a sharper focus.', '2006-07-02 20:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575467, 353263, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice color!</td>', 'Nice color!', '2006-07-02 20:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2575468, 353742, 55642, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of water motion shots in this one, and it has to really needs to be special to stand out. This is a lot like other waterfall shots we''ve seen both in this challenge and in the past. It''s easy to see their allure, though.</td>', 'There are a lot of water motion shots in this one, and it has to really needs to be special to stand out. This is a lot like other waterfall shots we''ve seen both in this challenge and in the past. It''s easy to see their allure, though.', '2006-07-02 20:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
