(2575473, 353614, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice waterfall! I like the addition of the boy, but I perhaps having him wave his arms wasn''t the best option. I''d like to see him a little more separated from the waterfall, more to the left.</td>', 'Nice waterfall! I like the addition of the boy, but I perhaps having him wave his arms wasn''t the best option. I''d like to see him a little more separated from the waterfall, more to the left.', '2006-07-02 20:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
