(2575543, 352358, 55642, '<td valign="top">I would like this better with a tighter square crop. The blur at the right and left edges is becoming negative space.</td>', 'I would like this better with a tighter square crop. The blur at the right and left edges is becoming negative space.', '2006-07-02 20:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
