(2576463, 353514, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations :) I had a very good hint this was yours. Has Larus'' style written all over it ;) which I do like btw. Though some more motion blur would''ve been nice I still found it good enough.<br/> <br/>I''ll quote ya ;)<br/> <br/>"don´t think it has enough motion blur or image quality for the voters to react well"<br/> <br/>I can understand where you''re coming from though, I too underrate or underestimate my work sometimes(maybe most of the time) but this image is oozing with image quality.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-03 00:35:47.</i></td>', 'Congratulations :) I had a very good hint this was yours. Has Larus'' style written all over it ;) which I do like btw. Though some more motion blur would''ve been nice I still found it good enough. I''ll quote ya ;) "don´t think it has enough motion blur or image quality for the voters to react well" I can understand where you''re coming from though, I too underrate or underestimate my work sometimes(maybe most of the time) but this image is oozing with image quality.', '2006-07-03 01:32:23.000000', '2006-07-03 01:35:47.000000', 0),
(2576477, 353297, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Margie-<br/> <br/>The concept isn''t new, but it''s still novel enough here to do well. I think it''s a brilliant want to depict the perpetual motion of a house full of children and the headache they can cause. Something about the lighting seems slightly off to me, but only just slightly. Look at how white his feet are, the light looks too white. You seem to have found your groove here, congrats!</td>', 'Hi Margie- The concept isn''t new, but it''s still novel enough here to do well. I think it''s a brilliant want to depict the perpetual motion of a house full of children and the headache they can cause. Something about the lighting seems slightly off to me, but only just slightly. Look at how white his feet are, the light looks too white. You seem to have found your groove here, congrats!', '2006-07-03 01:34:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2576494, 351895, 53147, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your front page finish! Well done.</td>', 'Congrats on your front page finish! Well done.', '2006-07-03 01:36:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2576509, 353516, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Shailesh-<br/> <br/>I think what hurts this photo most is that the background is too busy. It''s the only part of the photo in focus, so we search on it for a place of interest and find nothing, and the biker is there but somehow seems secondary to the leaves. It would work better with a plain background. Also, the lighting is natural, but too white. Shooting when the sun is low in the sky will give an outdoor subject a nice photogenic golden glow.</td>', 'Hi Shailesh- I think what hurts this photo most is that the background is too busy. It''s the only part of the photo in focus, so we search on it for a place of interest and find nothing, and the biker is there but somehow seems secondary to the leaves. It would work better with a plain background. Also, the lighting is natural, but too white. Shooting when the sun is low in the sky will give an outdoor subject a nice photogenic golden glow.', '2006-07-03 01:37:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2576531, 353410, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Richard-<br/> <br/>I''ll reiterate my comment about the green being too oversaturated. I am also not fond of that particular shade, just a little too kelly for my tastes. It''s very artsy photo, which doesn''t necessarily do as well around these parts, but it''s good to see you branching out and trying something a little different.</td>', 'Hi Richard- I''ll reiterate my comment about the green being too oversaturated. I am also not fond of that particular shade, just a little too kelly for my tastes. It''s very artsy photo, which doesn''t necessarily do as well around these parts, but it''s good to see you branching out and trying something a little different.', '2006-07-03 01:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2576549, 353393, 59343, '<td valign="top">nice finish.  after you told me i gave you a good review i wondered which one was yours.  I still think this is the best of the pool shots.  I hope to do as well in my upcoming challenge.</td>', 'nice finish.  after you told me i gave you a good review i wondered which one was yours.  I still think this is the best of the pool shots.  I hope to do as well in my upcoming challenge.', '2006-07-03 01:42:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2576553, 351272, 49706, '<td valign="top">You''ve read all about how people love your waves and rocks and clouds, so I''ll leave that out.<br/> <br/>The ship, however has had minimal attention, at least in the way of comments, and I''d have you know I like it and find it well placed (as far as aiming the camera - of course you didn''t <i>place</i> it there).<br/> <br/>Well done<br/>-Luke</td>', 'You''ve read all about how people love your waves and rocks and clouds, so I''ll leave that out. The ship, however has had minimal attention, at least in the way of comments, and I''d have you know I like it and find it well placed (as far as aiming the camera - of course you didn''t place it there). Well done-Luke', '2006-07-03 01:42:21.000000', NULL, 0),
