(2577469, 353514, 3032, '<td valign="top">It looked just like an advertisement shot. When I looked trough this challenge I even went trough some Volvo brochures to see if it wasn''t in there. :) Great shot.<br/> <br/></td>', 'It looked just like an advertisement shot. When I looked trough this challenge I even went trough some Volvo brochures to see if it wasn''t in there. :) Great shot. ', '2006-07-03 03:14:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2577495, 352846, 3032, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by texaskev:</b></div><hr/><i> Great shot!  How hard was it to get track side access? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>At Assen they have a new kind of stand. It hangs over the kitty litter and doesn''t have a fence. As a result you get very close to the action with unobstructed view, but when a rider crashes he slides into the gravel underneath the stand. Real trackside access is near impossible in MotoGP.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by texaskev: Great shot!  How hard was it to get track side access?   At Assen they have a new kind of stand. It hangs over the kitty litter and doesn''t have a fence. As a result you get very close to the action with unobstructed view, but when a rider crashes he slides into the gravel underneath the stand. Real trackside access is near impossible in MotoGP. ', '2006-07-03 03:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
