(2577835, 353362, 41337, '<td valign="top">LOL. Nice capture indeed. The only thing holding this back from an even higher score is the background, IMO. The right side of the background is more uniform and had it looked like that throughout it would have provided a nice backdrop. Beyond that I''m not sure what else to tell you to improve. I really like the angle here with the tilt. That alone makes me visualize how this bird is trying to lift the bread. Also, good detail with the subjects and the DOF works nicely.</td>', 'LOL. Nice capture indeed. The only thing holding this back from an even higher score is the background, IMO. The right side of the background is more uniform and had it looked like that throughout it would have provided a nice backdrop. Beyond that I''m not sure what else to tell you to improve. I really like the angle here with the tilt. That alone makes me visualize how this bird is trying to lift the bread. Also, good detail with the subjects and the DOF works nicely.', '2006-07-03 04:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2577841, 353514, 36606, '<td valign="top">thought this would take blue. Great shot mate.</td>', 'thought this would take blue. Great shot mate.', '2006-07-03 04:58:47.000000', NULL, 0),
