(2577869, 353215, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congrats dude, love the red warm tones in this one.  I definately think this is better than mine so well deserved, I would have had your place though if my score wouldn´t have dropped the last 2 days, was hanging at 6.9-6.95 for a long time :)</td>', 'Congrats dude, love the red warm tones in this one.  I definately think this is better than mine so well deserved, I would have had your place though if my score wouldn´t have dropped the last 2 days, was hanging at 6.9-6.95 for a long time :)', '2006-07-03 05:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2577872, 352846, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congrats dude, I can say the same about this shot as Alex Saberis, think it was better than mine and deserved the ribbon over it, was close though, my friday afternoon score would have beaten you both :)</td>', 'Congrats dude, I can say the same about this shot as Alex Saberis, think it was better than mine and deserved the ribbon over it, was close though, my friday afternoon score would have beaten you both :)', '2006-07-03 05:23:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2577898, 349735, 26679, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Gosh!  I expected this to be on the front page -- winner''s circle!!!  Not a bad score at all. . .but not nearly what it deserves.   This photo is GORGEOUS!!!  It''s one of my favorites of all time! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sandy<br/>Thanks for the support, I am a little dissapointed, but Im sure I will get back on that horse again...</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Gosh!  I expected this to be on the front page -- winner''s circle!!!  Not a bad score at all. . .but not nearly what it deserves.   This photo is GORGEOUS!!!  It''s one of my favorites of all time!   SandyThanks for the support, I am a little dissapointed, but Im sure I will get back on that horse again...', '2006-07-03 05:37:09.000000', NULL, 0),
