(2578233, 352850, 25355, '<td valign="top">I think these Colourscape things are great (I went in one in 1984 in London). It''s a shame it didn''t do so well in this Challenge - maybe if your model had been leaping across to show more motion...</td>', 'I think these Colourscape things are great (I went in one in 1984 in London). It''s a shame it didn''t do so well in this Challenge - maybe if your model had been leaping across to show more motion...', '2006-07-03 09:51:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2578253, 353215, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great catch, hunting with a Canon is a lot better than hunting with a gun in my opinion. :) Congrats on 2nd place.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great catch, hunting with a Canon is a lot better than hunting with a gun in my opinion. :) Congrats on 2nd place. ', '2006-07-03 10:00:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2578264, 353440, 3032, '<td valign="top">I knew that a hummingbird would have a good chance to win this, especially  a nicely shot one like this. Congrats on first place. :)</td>', 'I knew that a hummingbird would have a good chance to win this, especially  a nicely shot one like this. Congrats on first place. :)', '2006-07-03 10:02:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2578269, 353625, 53147, '<td valign="top">Thats ok man - get it out of your system. I have a couple of brown ribbon contenders up right now myself. Only one way to go now and that is way up baby - GO UNTOUCHABLES!!!</td>', 'Thats ok man - get it out of your system. I have a couple of brown ribbon contenders up right now myself. Only one way to go now and that is way up baby - GO UNTOUCHABLES!!!', '2006-07-03 10:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2578270, 352846, 3032, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Larus:</b></div><hr/><i> ...was close though, my friday afternoon score would have beaten you both :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>:)<br/>My score was close to 6.9 for much of the week, until I lost more than a tenth in only a couple of votes, it hovered around 6.77 after that.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Larus: ...was close though, my friday afternoon score would have beaten you both :)   :)My score was close to 6.9 for much of the week, until I lost more than a tenth in only a couple of votes, it hovered around 6.77 after that. ', '2006-07-03 10:05:39.000000', NULL, 0),
