(2579013, 352512, 37961, '<td valign="top">Yep, I would lose the border too. However it is a great shot and looks very inviting. That is how you know you have a winning shot. As you can tell by my comment during the challenge, I asked if it was swimmable? Made me want to get in there. Congrats on your personal best!! Lovely image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-03 12:16:40.</i></td>', 'Yep, I would lose the border too. However it is a great shot and looks very inviting. That is how you know you have a winning shot. As you can tell by my comment during the challenge, I asked if it was swimmable? Made me want to get in there. Congrats on your personal best!! Lovely image.', '2006-07-03 13:16:08.000000', '2006-07-03 13:16:40.000000', 0),
(2579017, 353569, 37961, '<td valign="top">I have an aussie. Yes they are fast. Thats why I named my aussie Rocket.<br/>He can effortlessly go from my house to the house next door to me in about 5 seconds (and its about 150 yards away). <br/> <br/>Very good pan on this one. Artistic pic.</td>', 'I have an aussie. Yes they are fast. Thats why I named my aussie Rocket.He can effortlessly go from my house to the house next door to me in about 5 seconds (and its about 150 yards away).  Very good pan on this one. Artistic pic.', '2006-07-03 13:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2579030, 352512, 22872, '<td valign="top">absolutely stunning!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'absolutely stunning!!! ', '2006-07-03 13:22:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2579033, 353397, 13084, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jutilda:</b></div><hr/><i> DUMB VOTERS~  This one got a 10 from me and it deserved a much higher placement!!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Jutilda for the 10 :-)  I guess different people have different taste.  However, I''m going to stick with my style even though it may not score that high from most voters.  I''m glad and really appreciate that there are others who enjoy looking at this photo as well.</td>', 'Originally posted by Jutilda: DUMB VOTERS~  This one got a 10 from me and it deserved a much higher placement!!!!   Thanks Jutilda for the 10 :-)  I guess different people have different taste.  However, I''m going to stick with my style even though it may not score that high from most voters.  I''m glad and really appreciate that there are others who enjoy looking at this photo as well.', '2006-07-03 13:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
