(2579204, 353440, 23913, '<td valign="top">very nice.<br/> <br/>i can''t tell you how jealous i am i''ve been trying to get a shot of one of these litle guy for awhile...its the exact same type of bird to red neck and all..i''m not sure the kind of humming bird. but hey its ok i''ll just sit here and stare for the next min. or to then i''ll use it as model shot for when ever i can find and take the one i''m stocking.<br/> <br/>again nicly done, and congrats on the blue<br/> <br/>(say when can we get together so an astro shoot?)<br/> <br/>_brando_</td>', 'very nice. i can''t tell you how jealous i am i''ve been trying to get a shot of one of these litle guy for awhile...its the exact same type of bird to red neck and all..i''m not sure the kind of humming bird. but hey its ok i''ll just sit here and stare for the next min. or to then i''ll use it as model shot for when ever i can find and take the one i''m stocking. again nicly done, and congrats on the blue (say when can we get together so an astro shoot?) _brando_', '2006-07-03 14:12:29.000000', NULL, 0),
