(2579287, 353397, 46882, '<td valign="top">Yes I agree.  I don''t understand why this got a low rating..??  I think it''s a great shot!  It''s a classic shot.  I don''t understand the votes sometimes.  Compare this to a person on a bike wit a blurred background..this one is much more story telling.  The bikes have been done over and over and over again.  I like your work and continue with your own style.</td>', 'Yes I agree.  I don''t understand why this got a low rating..??  I think it''s a great shot!  It''s a classic shot.  I don''t understand the votes sometimes.  Compare this to a person on a bike wit a blurred background..this one is much more story telling.  The bikes have been done over and over and over again.  I like your work and continue with your own style.', '2006-07-03 14:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2579501, 353054, 32754, '<td valign="top">This was way underrated, perhaps a little too avantgarde for the average person, but it was spectacular and unique.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-12 20:04:38.</i></td>', 'This was way underrated, perhaps a little too avantgarde for the average person, but it was spectacular and unique.', '2006-07-03 15:26:14.000000', '2006-07-12 21:04:38.000000', 0),
