(2623313, 353728, 3724, '<td valign="top">A good entry for this challenge..... Exhibits a interesting capture of a physical attribute of the bird in flight.  Motion in the water and on the bird portray a natural optical effect that develops a enjoyable rendering for this subject.  I voted 7 for plenty of canvas space &amp; subtle overall contrast in the water w/ beautiful shadow/reflection under the soft but appropriately defined dark bird.</td>', 'A good entry for this challenge..... Exhibits a interesting capture of a physical attribute of the bird in flight.  Motion in the water and on the bird portray a natural optical effect that develops a enjoyable rendering for this subject.  I voted 7 for plenty of canvas space & subtle overall contrast in the water w/ beautiful shadow/reflection under the soft but appropriately defined dark bird.', '2006-07-14 21:04:13.000000', NULL, 0),
